(836541, 93797, 4008, '<td valign="top">Not very original but a great shot anyway. Great color. And the  level of detail is amazing.  It is so sharp and you still have so much depth of field for such an extreme close-up. I will come back and see your lens details.</td>', 'Not very original but a great shot anyway. Great color. And the  level of detail is amazing.  It is so sharp and you still have so much depth of field for such an extreme close-up. I will come back and see your lens details.', '2004-08-02 04:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
