(837188, 94664, 9690, '<td valign="top">YIKES~!  Flys doing it!  The photo is great.  Great focus and detail.  I love that the foreground is sharp, but behind the flys is not.  Well... and there''s sex involved!  ~10</td>', 'YIKES~!  Flys doing it!  The photo is great.  Great focus and detail.  I love that the foreground is sharp, but behind the flys is not.  Well... and there''s sex involved!  ~10', '2004-08-02 13:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
