(837191, 95232, 9690, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a Barbie photographed so well.  Its kind of spooky because it almost looks like a very real person!  Great angle and focus.  ~10</td>', 'I''ve never seen a Barbie photographed so well.  Its kind of spooky because it almost looks like a very real person!  Great angle and focus.  ~10', '2004-08-02 13:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
