(837396, 95157, 21183, '<td valign="top">A WISH<br/>Make a wish, just one wish,<br/>and hope it comes true.<br/>See the scene of a dream<br/>the one that''s for you.<br/>Take a breath, purse your lips,<br/>then blow steadily<br/>on the light fluffy seeds<br/>spread out readily.<br/>Watch them dance on the breeze<br/>and fly on their wing,<br/>see them twirl in the air<br/>while they''re journeying.<br/>May the seeds and the wish<br/>find land and take root<br/>and the right kind of care<br/>to flower and to fruit.<br/> <br/>Sorry - couldn''t resist.  Perfect photo to go with this poem I once wrote!</td>', 'A WISHMake a wish, just one wish,and hope it comes true.See the scene of a dreamthe one that''s for you.Take a breath, purse your lips,then blow steadilyon the light fluffy seedsspread out readily.Watch them dance on the breezeand fly on their wing,see them twirl in the airwhile they''re journeying.May the seeds and the wishfind land and take rootand the right kind of careto flower and to fruit. Sorry - couldn''t resist.  Perfect photo to go with this poem I once wrote!', '2004-08-02 15:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(837400, 94753, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is great.  So interesting.  It looks 3-dimensional.</td>', 'This is great.  So interesting.  It looks 3-dimensional.', '2004-08-02 15:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(837402, 95129, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture.  It is so crystal clear, and very creative.</td>', 'I really like this picture.  It is so crystal clear, and very creative.', '2004-08-02 15:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(837405, 93789, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely amazing!   An undisputed 10.  Especially considering how fast hummingbirds are always moving!   Congratulations!</td>', 'This is absolutely amazing!   An undisputed 10.  Especially considering how fast hummingbirds are always moving!   Congratulations!', '2004-08-02 15:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
