(837453, 95314, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, I tried so hard to do this.  You pulled it off.  Nice one.  Not easy, for sure!</td>', 'Oh, I tried so hard to do this.  You pulled it off.  Nice one.  Not easy, for sure!', '2004-08-02 15:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
