(837735, 94381, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good picture technically and probably difficult to get focus just right. If it were me, I''d move the subject a little to the right or left to make the comp more interesting.</td>', 'Good picture technically and probably difficult to get focus just right. If it were me, I''d move the subject a little to the right or left to make the comp more interesting.', '2004-08-02 18:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(837736, 94348, 24239, '<td valign="top">beautifully done, the green background is a little off, just seems like not the right green.</td>', 'beautifully done, the green background is a little off, just seems like not the right green.', '2004-08-02 18:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(837738, 94511, 489, '<td valign="top">Great shot - I love the solitary insect on the leaf - really makes it stand out in sharp contrast.</td>', 'Great shot - I love the solitary insect on the leaf - really makes it stand out in sharp contrast.', '2004-08-02 18:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(837740, 93995, 18197, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit over exposed. Loweer lighting and possibly from multiple light sources would have helped.</td>', 'Seems a bit over exposed. Loweer lighting and possibly from multiple light sources would have helped.', '2004-08-02 18:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(837741, 95239, 24239, '<td valign="top">wow! but then again, you probably know that! great capture, surely a contender!</td>', 'wow! but then again, you probably know that! great capture, surely a contender!', '2004-08-02 18:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(837743, 95238, 489, '<td valign="top">Direct sunlight can be very, very harsh. I would love to see this in early morning or late afternoon light.</td>', 'Direct sunlight can be very, very harsh. I would love to see this in early morning or late afternoon light.', '2004-08-02 18:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(837744, 94366, 24239, '<td valign="top">nice point of view!</td>', 'nice point of view!', '2004-08-02 18:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(837745, 94973, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good workman like image. I like the greater shadows on one side. Maybe just a bit mre contrast overall would have helped.</td>', 'Good workman like image. I like the greater shadows on one side. Maybe just a bit mre contrast overall would have helped.', '2004-08-02 18:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(837747, 95157, 24239, '<td valign="top">nice colors and texture</td>', 'nice colors and texture', '2004-08-02 18:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(837748, 94121, 24239, '<td valign="top">the color is a bit strong</td>', 'the color is a bit strong', '2004-08-02 18:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(837749, 94233, 18197, '<td valign="top">Seems blown out. And I can''t see what I''m looking at beyond just abstract positive and negative space.</td>', 'Seems blown out. And I can''t see what I''m looking at beyond just abstract positive and negative space.', '2004-08-02 18:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(837750, 94564, 489, '<td valign="top">Neat capture - love the complementing colors.</td>', 'Neat capture - love the complementing colors.', '2004-08-02 18:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(837753, 95147, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great (!!!) ficus and lighting. Nice colors and comp. Cooperative subject.</td>', 'Great (!!!) ficus and lighting. Nice colors and comp. Cooperative subject.', '2004-08-02 18:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(837754, 94866, 24239, '<td valign="top">quick! get it off! save the rose!<br/>nice shot though!</td>', 'quick! get it off! save the rose!nice shot though!', '2004-08-02 18:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(837758, 94296, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice image, especially if you are involved with the subjects in any way. You''ve captured a wonderful expression which creates an emotional response. But not really what I think of when I think macro.</td>', 'Nice image, especially if you are involved with the subjects in any way. You''ve captured a wonderful expression which creates an emotional response. But not really what I think of when I think macro.', '2004-08-02 18:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(837760, 94709, 24239, '<td valign="top">ha ha ha</td>', 'ha ha ha', '2004-08-02 18:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(837764, 94381, 24239, '<td valign="top">would have liked tighter cropping, tall vertical perhaps. nice &amp; colorful. i like the texture on the red</td>', 'would have liked tighter cropping, tall vertical perhaps. nice & colorful. i like the texture on the red', '2004-08-02 18:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(837766, 94479, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and converging lines. Contrast between reds and black is dramatic.</td>', 'Nice perspective and converging lines. Contrast between reds and black is dramatic.', '2004-08-02 18:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(837767, 94192, 24239, '<td valign="top">background is a bit distracting</td>', 'background is a bit distracting', '2004-08-02 18:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(837768, 94536, 24239, '<td valign="top">nice &amp; simple</td>', 'nice & simple', '2004-08-02 18:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(837769, 94530, 18197, '<td valign="top">Yet another flower, but well done. I suppose tulip blossoms could be green but not in my experience. I am wondering if my monitor is off or if this is a bit color shifted.</td>', 'Yet another flower, but well done. I suppose tulip blossoms could be green but not in my experience. I am wondering if my monitor is off or if this is a bit color shifted.', '2004-08-02 18:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(837774, 94735, 24239, '<td valign="top">nice colors &amp; focus, show incredible motion</td>', 'nice colors & focus, show incredible motion', '2004-08-02 18:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(837777, 94121, 18197, '<td valign="top">Background detracts from the blossoms. Colors seem flat. Too many blossoms to focus interest on (my eye just keeps flying around the image with no place to settle.) Possibly focusing on a single flower, shallowing DOF and some extra side-lighting would have helped.</td>', 'Background detracts from the blossoms. Colors seem flat. Too many blossoms to focus interest on (my eye just keeps flying around the image with no place to settle.) Possibly focusing on a single flower, shallowing DOF and some extra side-lighting would have helped.', '2004-08-02 18:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(837779, 94355, 24239, '<td valign="top">fabulous colors &amp; composition</td>', 'fabulous colors & composition', '2004-08-02 18:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(837787, 94988, 18197, '<td valign="top">Yet another bug ... but if you''ve got to be a bug ... Wow! The lighting, especially of the wings, is fantastic. I don''t mind the tail being out of focus, but if the head were in focus, this would get 1-2 more points from me.</td>', 'Yet another bug ... but if you''ve got to be a bug ... Wow! The lighting, especially of the wings, is fantastic. I don''t mind the tail being out of focus, but if the head were in focus, this would get 1-2 more points from me.', '2004-08-02 18:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(837789, 95272, 8139, '<td valign="top">I like abstracts. This one is pretty good</td>', 'I like abstracts. This one is pretty good', '2004-08-02 18:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(837791, 95054, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not really what I think of when i think macro. Nice comp though, good colors and DOF.</td>', 'Not really what I think of when i think macro. Nice comp though, good colors and DOF.', '2004-08-02 18:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(837794, 95108, 24239, '<td valign="top">original concept &amp; very humorous</td>', 'original concept & very humorous', '2004-08-02 18:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(837795, 94445, 24239, '<td valign="top">not sure if I like the blue leaves</td>', 'not sure if I like the blue leaves', '2004-08-02 18:23:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(837797, 94865, 18197, '<td valign="top">The overhead lighting hurts this image somewhat. Perhaps multiple light sources would have been better and closer to the plane of the circuit board. Watch on TV for an Intel Ad and see how they make circuits interesting ... try emulating that.</td>', 'The overhead lighting hurts this image somewhat. Perhaps multiple light sources would have been better and closer to the plane of the circuit board. Watch on TV for an Intel Ad and see how they make circuits interesting ... try emulating that.', '2004-08-02 18:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(837799, 94328, 24239, '<td valign="top">would have preferred to see all of the eyelashes, crop seems a bit too tight</td>', 'would have preferred to see all of the eyelashes, crop seems a bit too tight', '2004-08-02 18:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(837800, 94382, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice workmanlike image. Technically fine. Composition is fine and I like the way the lines inthe spoon lead my eye around. Good job.</td>', 'Nice workmanlike image. Technically fine. Composition is fine and I like the way the lines inthe spoon lead my eye around. Good job.', '2004-08-02 18:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(837804, 95183, 19425, '<td valign="top">sweet macro!</td>', 'sweet macro!', '2004-08-02 18:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(837807, 94245, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed image. Desaturating it hurts the overall effect I think. Lighting feels a little flat.</td>', 'Nicely composed image. Desaturating it hurts the overall effect I think. Lighting feels a little flat.', '2004-08-02 18:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(837812, 95283, 24239, '<td valign="top">nice colors, shame it''s a bit grainy</td>', 'nice colors, shame it''s a bit grainy', '2004-08-02 18:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(837813, 94511, 24239, '<td valign="top">nice title!</td>', 'nice title!', '2004-08-02 18:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(837814, 94478, 24239, '<td valign="top">good use of a bug, a little hard to see it though</td>', 'good use of a bug, a little hard to see it though', '2004-08-02 18:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(837815, 94463, 24239, '<td valign="top">sharp photo!</td>', 'sharp photo!', '2004-08-02 18:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(837833, 94769, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good potential. Great colors. Needs more dof or, imo, the focus should be on the rusted bolt. If you shoot parallel to the object you will get more perceived dof because everything will be on the same focal plane.</td>', 'Good potential. Great colors. Needs more dof or, imo, the focus should be on the rusted bolt. If you shoot parallel to the object you will get more perceived dof because everything will be on the same focal plane.', '2004-08-02 18:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(837837, 94355, 14476, '<td valign="top">This beauty creates his own abstract images.  You composed this well, the colors are great and I hope you score very nicely with this one.  I''ll do my part with a 10.</td>', 'This beauty creates his own abstract images.  You composed this well, the colors are great and I hope you score very nicely with this one.  I''ll do my part with a 10.', '2004-08-02 18:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(837839, 95111, 11800, '<td valign="top">Fine execution with good lighting. It''s not very interesting, imo. Sorry.</td>', 'Fine execution with good lighting. It''s not very interesting, imo. Sorry.', '2004-08-02 18:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(837841, 95073, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lovely abstract. While I wish more of it was in focus, the colors and composition work well in this image.</td>', 'Lovely abstract. While I wish more of it was in focus, the colors and composition work well in this image.', '2004-08-02 18:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(837843, 95132, 14476, '<td valign="top">Personal preferance, of course, but I''d also love to see this cropped tighter so that magnificant, well focused head didn''t have to compete with the OOF body.</td>', 'Personal preferance, of course, but I''d also love to see this cropped tighter so that magnificant, well focused head didn''t have to compete with the OOF body.', '2004-08-02 18:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(837851, 95062, 11800, '<td valign="top">Meets the technical part of the challenge very well. Good job on focusing and lighting. The colors are good. It''s not very interesting and that''s part of the challenge also.</td>', 'Meets the technical part of the challenge very well. Good job on focusing and lighting. The colors are good. It''s not very interesting and that''s part of the challenge also.', '2004-08-02 18:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(837854, 95272, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice crispt abstract.  Well seen.</td>', 'Nice crispt abstract.  Well seen.', '2004-08-02 18:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(837855, 94228, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, very good one!  Every once in a while I see something completely new, and this is one of those times.  Thanks!   Expect you will do well in the Competition with this.</td>', 'Oh, very good one!  Every once in a while I see something completely new, and this is one of those times.  Thanks!   Expect you will do well in the Competition with this.', '2004-08-02 18:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(837856, 93883, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good colors.  Like a pastel fairyland in there.</td>', 'Good colors.  Like a pastel fairyland in there.', '2004-08-02 18:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(837859, 95198, 14476, '<td valign="top">My goodness, that''s a Sparkplug, isn''t it!  Really neat to capture the firing on this one.  Hope you do very well with this excellent image.</td>', 'My goodness, that''s a Sparkplug, isn''t it!  Really neat to capture the firing on this one.  Hope you do very well with this excellent image.', '2004-08-02 18:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(837860, 95034, 11800, '<td valign="top">Those are different! There seems to be a yellow cast to the picture which, imo, should be at least partially corrected.</td>', 'Those are different! There seems to be a yellow cast to the picture which, imo, should be at least partially corrected.', '2004-08-02 18:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(837864, 95129, 14476, '<td valign="top">Cute pun.  I''d probably left out the applicator at upper right, and tried for slightly crisper focus, but still a really good idea.</td>', 'Cute pun.  I''d probably left out the applicator at upper right, and tried for slightly crisper focus, but still a really good idea.', '2004-08-02 18:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(837870, 94329, 11800, '<td valign="top">Day lilly seed pod? Might have looke more ineresting in b/w</td>', 'Day lilly seed pod? Might have looke more ineresting in b/w', '2004-08-02 19:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(837874, 94827, 14476, '<td valign="top">These types of shots sometimes are helped by bracketing your depth of field (aperture) so the foreground is nice and crisp and the background gets fuzzy and less distracting. Lovely colors in this image;  border could be smaller...</td>', 'These types of shots sometimes are helped by bracketing your depth of field (aperture) so the foreground is nice and crisp and the background gets fuzzy and less distracting. Lovely colors in this image;  border could be smaller...', '2004-08-02 19:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(837882, 94948, 14476, '<td valign="top">If you have the pixels, it would be fun to see this cropped so that just the in-focus parts are framed.  Still, it''s a lovely rendition of water droplets on branches.</td>', 'If you have the pixels, it would be fun to see this cropped so that just the in-focus parts are framed.  Still, it''s a lovely rendition of water droplets on branches.', '2004-08-02 19:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(837884, 95009, 14476, '<td valign="top">My goodness.  This one''s different!  Lives on Mars, does he?  Seriously, great shot and I hope you do well with this one.</td>', 'My goodness.  This one''s different!  Lives on Mars, does he?  Seriously, great shot and I hope you do well with this one.', '2004-08-02 19:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(837886, 94688, 9002, '<td valign="top">good shot with good colours, perfect dof and focus</td>', 'good shot with good colours, perfect dof and focus', '2004-08-02 19:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(837888, 95326, 14476, '<td valign="top">There''s something very appealing about this earthy picture of blueberries.  The desaturation works well and, yes, I''d hang that one on my wall.  Good luck!  10</td>', 'There''s something very appealing about this earthy picture of blueberries.  The desaturation works well and, yes, I''d hang that one on my wall.  Good luck!  10', '2004-08-02 19:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(837890, 95298, 14476, '<td valign="top">What fun to make a mess for Art.  Nice photography and fine composition.</td>', 'What fun to make a mess for Art.  Nice photography and fine composition.', '2004-08-02 19:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(837891, 95009, 9002, '<td valign="top">stunning!</td>', 'stunning!', '2004-08-02 19:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(837892, 93797, 14476, '<td valign="top">I still can''t believe what I''m seeing in this image.  Splendid, of course.</td>', 'I still can''t believe what I''m seeing in this image.  Splendid, of course.', '2004-08-02 19:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(837895, 95225, 13610, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and lighting. too shallow DOF and subject not so inteesting (5)</td>', 'Interesting composition and lighting. too shallow DOF and subject not so inteesting (5)', '2004-08-02 19:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(837896, 94743, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really like the depth and all the bright colors in this one!  Very interesting.</td>', 'I really like the depth and all the bright colors in this one!  Very interesting.', '2004-08-02 19:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(837897, 94753, 13610, '<td valign="top">Too shallow DOF and the composition seem a bit flat. Good exposure and details (5)</td>', 'Too shallow DOF and the composition seem a bit flat. Good exposure and details (5)', '2004-08-02 19:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(837899, 95237, 13610, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem like a macro to me. It''s a great shot but not enough of a close up to be a macro.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem like a macro to me. It''s a great shot but not enough of a close up to be a macro.', '2004-08-02 19:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(837900, 95196, 13610, '<td valign="top">Not enough DOF to get this picture interesting.</td>', 'Not enough DOF to get this picture interesting.', '2004-08-02 19:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(837902, 95183, 24454, '<td valign="top">Really ugly bug, but a really great picture!  Good job!</td>', 'Really ugly bug, but a really great picture!  Good job!', '2004-08-02 19:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(837904, 95229, 14476, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this very nice photo because I like the composition, color and glow.  I wonder if you might try using a reflective diffuser on this type of shot to eliminate the shadows (on the mushrooms) but still keep the glow.  Still, it has a lot going for it, as is.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this very nice photo because I like the composition, color and glow.  I wonder if you might try using a reflective diffuser on this type of shot to eliminate the shadows (on the mushrooms) but still keep the glow.  Still, it has a lot going for it, as is.', '2004-08-02 19:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(837905, 93958, 13610, '<td valign="top">Really impressive. You have the touch for the DOF.</td>', 'Really impressive. You have the touch for the DOF.', '2004-08-02 19:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(837907, 93659, 13610, '<td valign="top">not enough DOF</td>', 'not enough DOF', '2004-08-02 19:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(837911, 94228, 22922, '<td valign="top">Nice image, good thinking with the illusion aspect, this wouldn''t be as interesting right side up.</td>', 'Nice image, good thinking with the illusion aspect, this wouldn''t be as interesting right side up.', '2004-08-02 19:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(837983, 94296, 20115, '<td valign="top">This is a really great shot, I would have removed the freckes--they are distracting.</td>', 'This is a really great shot, I would have removed the freckes--they are distracting.', '2004-08-02 20:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(838031, 94636, 22975, '<td valign="top">What a lucky capture.  :)</td>', 'What a lucky capture.  :)', '2004-08-02 20:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(838033, 94731, 22975, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous.  One of the best I''ve seen, the colors are just striking.  :)  Best of luck!</td>', 'This is gorgeous.  One of the best I''ve seen, the colors are just striking.  :)  Best of luck!', '2004-08-02 20:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(838034, 95182, 22975, '<td valign="top">Something other than a bug!  (Not that I''m biased...)  Nice idea!</td>', 'Something other than a bug!  (Not that I''m biased...)  Nice idea!', '2004-08-02 20:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(838035, 94773, 22975, '<td valign="top">Quite creepy, let''s just hope this is your pet.  ;)  The eyes are so interesting, I want to turn and run, but they almost look like they''re teasing me.  I really like this one, even though the tongue''s blurry, that just makes it more active... like it''s hungry and about to attack.  Great shot.</td>', 'Quite creepy, let''s just hope this is your pet.  ;)  The eyes are so interesting, I want to turn and run, but they almost look like they''re teasing me.  I really like this one, even though the tongue''s blurry, that just makes it more active... like it''s hungry and about to attack.  Great shot.', '2004-08-02 20:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(838037, 95232, 22975, '<td valign="top">This is a unique take on the challenge, and I absolutely LOVE it.  I would frame this and hang it on my wall if it were mine!  The lighting is so nice.  And the subject is so refreshing amongst all the icky bugs!  ;)</td>', 'This is a unique take on the challenge, and I absolutely LOVE it.  I would frame this and hang it on my wall if it were mine!  The lighting is so nice.  And the subject is so refreshing amongst all the icky bugs!  ;)', '2004-08-02 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(838038, 94602, 22975, '<td valign="top">That''s a really pretty flower.  I like the texture of it.  Good job.</td>', 'That''s a really pretty flower.  I like the texture of it.  Good job.', '2004-08-02 20:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(838039, 95167, 22975, '<td valign="top">Love the angle, love the title.  :)  Great capture.</td>', 'Love the angle, love the title.  :)  Great capture.', '2004-08-02 20:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(838042, 94280, 22975, '<td valign="top">Gosh, is that what they look like up close?  ;)  Nice color, very candy-like.</td>', 'Gosh, is that what they look like up close?  ;)  Nice color, very candy-like.', '2004-08-02 20:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(838044, 95183, 22975, '<td valign="top">WOW.  Such an incredible shot and such an menacing-looking insect.  The detail is fabulous.</td>', 'WOW.  Such an incredible shot and such an menacing-looking insect.  The detail is fabulous.', '2004-08-02 20:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(838045, 95343, 22975, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty... it almost doesn''t look like a flower!  I love the colors.</td>', 'This is so pretty... it almost doesn''t look like a flower!  I love the colors.', '2004-08-02 20:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(838046, 94405, 22975, '<td valign="top">This is so crisp, I really like it.  And I like the crop, too.</td>', 'This is so crisp, I really like it.  And I like the crop, too.', '2004-08-02 20:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(838051, 93659, 22975, '<td valign="top">The bugs just get uglier and uglier, but fortunately, the shots are still quite interesting.  I like this one''s iridescent wings.  (I probably didn''t spell that right, so I apologize.)</td>', 'The bugs just get uglier and uglier, but fortunately, the shots are still quite interesting.  I like this one''s iridescent wings.  (I probably didn''t spell that right, so I apologize.)', '2004-08-02 20:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(838052, 95029, 22975, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this photo, even though it''s not as close-up as many in the challenge.  I would have cropped the right side for composition, but this is nice.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this photo, even though it''s not as close-up as many in the challenge.  I would have cropped the right side for composition, but this is nice.', '2004-08-02 20:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(838054, 95034, 22975, '<td valign="top">Nice shadows!</td>', 'Nice shadows!', '2004-08-02 20:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(838056, 95316, 22975, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the green branch-y things.  They look like little braids.</td>', 'Nice detail on the green branch-y things.  They look like little braids.', '2004-08-02 20:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(838058, 94283, 22975, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  Black was a good background choice, I like the contrast it gives.</td>', 'I really like this one.  Black was a good background choice, I like the contrast it gives.', '2004-08-02 20:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(838060, 95039, 22975, '<td valign="top">Good title, it seems he''s moving around a bit, fixing up his home, maybe.  :)</td>', 'Good title, it seems he''s moving around a bit, fixing up his home, maybe.  :)', '2004-08-02 20:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(838063, 93966, 22975, '<td valign="top">I wish I knew how all of you got so up close and personal with these bugs AND managed to keep a still camera... I love the eye color on this one.</td>', 'I wish I knew how all of you got so up close and personal with these bugs AND managed to keep a still camera... I love the eye color on this one.', '2004-08-02 20:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(838066, 95239, 22975, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.</td>', 'Simply beautiful.', '2004-08-02 20:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(838068, 94592, 22975, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast in between the yellow and white.  The detail is nice, too.</td>', 'I love the contrast in between the yellow and white.  The detail is nice, too.', '2004-08-02 20:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
