(839120, 95170, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great specimen - and he/she picked a good color flower to pose on.  Light green background compliments nicely.</td>', 'Great specimen - and he/she picked a good color flower to pose on.  Light green background compliments nicely.', '2004-08-03 11:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(839145, 95262, 3697, '<td valign="top">I really like this, the bold colors really make it pop. Nice work.</td>', 'I really like this, the bold colors really make it pop. Nice work.', '2004-08-03 12:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(839150, 95077, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great photo. It may be natural but it looks like there is some haloing around the leaf borders. If you did some selective blurring, you''ll need to watch for that.</td>', 'Great photo. It may be natural but it looks like there is some haloing around the leaf borders. If you did some selective blurring, you''ll need to watch for that.', '2004-08-03 12:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(839155, 94664, 18197, '<td valign="top">Yet another bug hunt. I like the focus and the diagonal grain of the wood. The nail head does a nice job of balancing the image. With TWO bugs, you can claim Macro and Action! (LOL) Nice image. Good luck.</td>', 'Yet another bug hunt. I like the focus and the diagonal grain of the wood. The nail head does a nice job of balancing the image. With TWO bugs, you can claim Macro and Action! (LOL) Nice image. Good luck.', '2004-08-03 12:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(839160, 95095, 18197, '<td valign="top">What in the heck is this? It''s an arresting image, that''s for sure. The lighting is good but the foreground (er, the part at the top) seems a little too dark and loses some definition do to loss of contrast. I hope I don''t have nightmares about this.</td>', 'What in the heck is this? It''s an arresting image, that''s for sure. The lighting is good but the foreground (er, the part at the top) seems a little too dark and loses some definition do to loss of contrast. I hope I don''t have nightmares about this.', '2004-08-03 12:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(839187, 93797, 11518, '<td valign="top">Holy Molly!  This is what I call and extreme closeup!  Was it alive still? ;-)  Jacko no doubt!  And if your are not Jacko, take it as a compliment! LOL 10</td>', 'Holy Molly!  This is what I call and extreme closeup!  Was it alive still? ;-)  Jacko no doubt!  And if your are not Jacko, take it as a compliment! LOL 10', '2004-08-03 12:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(839211, 93985, 19751, '<td valign="top">awwwww i love it i love it i love it!!!! there are a couple of weird things though. 1) on the left half, where there isnt a shadow, it looks like a perfect white background. however, underneath the leaf, there is texture. I think it should have been one way or the other. very nice though. 2) the white part of the leaf blends too much into the background, so there isn''t much contrast. 3) the leaf looks a tiiiiiiiny bit out of focus. <br/>Overall, i love the composition and I think you did a great job. Hope it ribbons or top tens!</td>', 'awwwww i love it i love it i love it!!!! there are a couple of weird things though. 1) on the left half, where there isnt a shadow, it looks like a perfect white background. however, underneath the leaf, there is texture. I think it should have been one way or the other. very nice though. 2) the white part of the leaf blends too much into the background, so there isn''t much contrast. 3) the leaf looks a tiiiiiiiny bit out of focus. Overall, i love the composition and I think you did a great job. Hope it ribbons or top tens!', '2004-08-03 13:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(839216, 95313, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great image. I am fascinated why the square image and centered subject work. I think it might have to do with the eye discounting or deducting the white space. The remaining image then has a different balance and subject placement. Whatever the reason, this is a nice image, well captured. Reminds me of Godzilla vs Mothra.</td>', 'Great image. I am fascinated why the square image and centered subject work. I think it might have to do with the eye discounting or deducting the white space. The remaining image then has a different balance and subject placement. Whatever the reason, this is a nice image, well captured. Reminds me of Godzilla vs Mothra.', '2004-08-03 13:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(839217, 95132, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great picture and it''s not a bug or a flower. I love the focus, DOF and reflections. Great capture.</td>', 'Great picture and it''s not a bug or a flower. I love the focus, DOF and reflections. Great capture.', '2004-08-03 13:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(839219, 94666, 18197, '<td valign="top">Zen-like. I like it a great deal. My only nit pick has to do with the focus which is most noticeable on the water droplets.</td>', 'Zen-like. I like it a great deal. My only nit pick has to do with the focus which is most noticeable on the water droplets.', '2004-08-03 13:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(839229, 94220, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Levels are good. Colors are good. I really like the negative space. Reflections are good, especially around the leaves. Without them, it would look pretty flat.</td>', 'Nice image. Levels are good. Colors are good. I really like the negative space. Reflections are good, especially around the leaves. Without them, it would look pretty flat.', '2004-08-03 13:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(839231, 95029, 18197, '<td valign="top">Bugs, bugs, and more bugs! Nice image though ... possibly 70th percentile of all the bugs. I''d give it another point if focus were a little sharper. Hard when these buggars move around.</td>', 'Bugs, bugs, and more bugs! Nice image though ... possibly 70th percentile of all the bugs. I''d give it another point if focus were a little sharper. Hard when these buggars move around.', '2004-08-03 13:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(839239, 95157, 18197, '<td valign="top">Oh, I like that. Contrast between white seeds and dark background is very nice. I''m glad you didn''t crop more of the background out! I like the focus. A little busy</td>', 'Oh, I like that. Contrast between white seeds and dark background is very nice. I''m glad you didn''t crop more of the background out! I like the focus. A little busy', '2004-08-03 13:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(839243, 94554, 18197, '<td valign="top">Another bug hunt; Alien meets the Fly! (LOL) A good image technically (colors, focus, DOF, ...) but it doesn''t seem to "pop." I think the fly''s colors are so similar to the colors behind it, it blends in a bit. Middle of the pack among bug photos.</td>', 'Another bug hunt; Alien meets the Fly! (LOL) A good image technically (colors, focus, DOF, ...) but it doesn''t seem to "pop." I think the fly''s colors are so similar to the colors behind it, it blends in a bit. Middle of the pack among bug photos.', '2004-08-03 13:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(839245, 94467, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not your fault, but I''m getting buggy about bugs. This is a good photo but the spider seems flat. I don''t see any shadowing that would give it 3 dimensionality. That would have raised the score for me.</td>', 'Not your fault, but I''m getting buggy about bugs. This is a good photo but the spider seems flat. I don''t see any shadowing that would give it 3 dimensionality. That would have raised the score for me.', '2004-08-03 13:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(839249, 94785, 18197, '<td valign="top">Just looked at another spider photo, similar size, subject, and comp. This is better because it has some nice shadowing to give a 3 dimensional feel to it. Good job.</td>', 'Just looked at another spider photo, similar size, subject, and comp. This is better because it has some nice shadowing to give a 3 dimensional feel to it. Good job.', '2004-08-03 13:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(839252, 94493, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the subject. How''d you get the subject to stand still? Feels a little unbalanced to me ...</td>', 'Nice focus on the subject. How''d you get the subject to stand still? Feels a little unbalanced to me ...', '2004-08-03 13:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(839255, 95198, 4338, '<td valign="top">interesting, I would like to know how you did this after the voting is over</td>', 'interesting, I would like to know how you did this after the voting is over', '2004-08-03 13:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(839256, 94394, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very good. Among the flowers, top 10 percentile. Color, comp, DOF and focus are great. Contrast and shadows give it nice depth.</td>', 'Very good. Among the flowers, top 10 percentile. Color, comp, DOF and focus are great. Contrast and shadows give it nice depth.', '2004-08-03 13:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(839258, 95039, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''m getting pretty tired of bugs but this restores my confidence inthe genre. Great image due to colors, focus, and DOF. For me the diagonal comp really works. Nicely done!</td>', 'I''m getting pretty tired of bugs but this restores my confidence inthe genre. Great image due to colors, focus, and DOF. For me the diagonal comp really works. Nicely done!', '2004-08-03 13:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(839259, 95220, 4338, '<td valign="top">the lighting looks a litle too soft, nice shot other wise</td>', 'the lighting looks a litle too soft, nice shot other wise', '2004-08-03 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(839260, 93870, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but the stark white background without releif makes my teeth hurt. I wonder if a different aspect ratio where the subject fills more of the frame would have helped?</td>', 'Interesting idea but the stark white background without releif makes my teeth hurt. I wonder if a different aspect ratio where the subject fills more of the frame would have helped?', '2004-08-03 13:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(839265, 93875, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice, technically good, bug shot but from where i sit in the bottom half of the genre. Other bug shots seem to pop more. Maybe it''s the flat lighting.</td>', 'Nice, technically good, bug shot but from where i sit in the bottom half of the genre. Other bug shots seem to pop more. Maybe it''s the flat lighting.', '2004-08-03 13:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(839270, 94547, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fine photo but subject and comp don''t creat a sense of interest for me.</td>', 'Fine photo but subject and comp don''t creat a sense of interest for me.', '2004-08-03 13:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(839272, 94690, 18197, '<td valign="top">The stark contrast between black and yellow makes an interesting abstract pattern. Nice use of negative space. But not enough to compete with the other bugs and flowers. Good attempt but tough tough competition.</td>', 'The stark contrast between black and yellow makes an interesting abstract pattern. Nice use of negative space. But not enough to compete with the other bugs and flowers. Good attempt but tough tough competition.', '2004-08-03 13:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(839277, 94996, 18197, '<td valign="top">Technically competent image. Subject is too busy for my eye to rest. Not enough context for me to resonate with the image. Without the title, I''d be lost.</td>', 'Technically competent image. Subject is too busy for my eye to rest. Not enough context for me to resonate with the image. Without the title, I''d be lost.', '2004-08-03 13:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(839282, 94250, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Comp is terrific. Focus is very good. DOF interesting. Top third of the flower genre this challenge.</td>', 'Nice image. Comp is terrific. Focus is very good. DOF interesting. Top third of the flower genre this challenge.', '2004-08-03 13:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(839289, 95295, 19608, '<td valign="top">The lighting on some of the blossoms is exquisite.   You definitely found a nice specimen to shoot and some great lighting to boot.  The balck backgrouns behind the white petals is perfect.  This is not really that "macro" so it would have been better to get close on the blossoms with good light.  As it is, almost the left half is a jumbled OOF mess.</td>', 'The lighting on some of the blossoms is exquisite.   You definitely found a nice specimen to shoot and some great lighting to boot.  The balck backgrouns behind the white petals is perfect.  This is not really that "macro" so it would have been better to get close on the blossoms with good light.  As it is, almost the left half is a jumbled OOF mess.', '2004-08-03 13:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(839290, 95283, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract image. Way good enough to be in a stock photo collection. DOF must have been incredibly shallow. I think if the focus were sharper, especially on the left, I''d resonate with this more.</td>', 'Nice abstract image. Way good enough to be in a stock photo collection. DOF must have been incredibly shallow. I think if the focus were sharper, especially on the left, I''d resonate with this more.', '2004-08-03 13:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(839293, 95313, 19608, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a close-up.  HAs to be way more than 1:1  gIven the magnification, you''ve handled the DoF very well.</td>', 'Now that''s a close-up.  HAs to be way more than 1:1  gIven the magnification, you''ve handled the DoF very well.', '2004-08-03 13:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(839294, 94240, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good image. Web is a bit distracting as are the white streaks in the background. The spider isn''t really defined much by shadows. Some of the other spider pics have a great 3 dimensionality due to shadowing. Check them out and see if that would have improved this.</td>', 'Good image. Web is a bit distracting as are the white streaks in the background. The spider isn''t really defined much by shadows. Some of the other spider pics have a great 3 dimensionality due to shadowing. Check them out and see if that would have improved this.', '2004-08-03 13:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(839298, 93652, 18197, '<td valign="top">Yet another bug pic. Still, this is among the top half of the genre. Focus is perfect. I like the DOF. Colors and contrast work. Great capture!</td>', 'Yet another bug pic. Still, this is among the top half of the genre. Focus is perfect. I like the DOF. Colors and contrast work. Great capture!', '2004-08-03 13:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(839299, 95077, 19608, '<td valign="top">The leaf and the veins in it are totally superb.  Take the same shot with the area in the background totally black and you have a real wow winner.  (Or use post shoot processing to do it later.)  Great focus on the leaf - great exposure on the lesf.</td>', 'The leaf and the veins in it are totally superb.  Take the same shot with the area in the background totally black and you have a real wow winner.  (Or use post shoot processing to do it later.)  Great focus on the leaf - great exposure on the lesf.', '2004-08-03 13:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(839302, 95225, 19608, '<td valign="top">Cute idea - very colorful and playful.  The pins cut in half on the edges are unfortunate.</td>', 'Cute idea - very colorful and playful.  The pins cut in half on the edges are unfortunate.', '2004-08-03 13:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(839305, 93995, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - excellent selection of colors and background.  Highlight on the glass just a bit harsh.</td>', 'Nice idea - excellent selection of colors and background.  Highlight on the glass just a bit harsh.', '2004-08-03 13:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(839311, 95245, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wayyy close-up.  Perfect exposure on the beetle brings out those great colors.  Black background is the exact one to make this work so well.  Get rid of the funky border - this image does not need it.</td>', 'Wayyy close-up.  Perfect exposure on the beetle brings out those great colors.  Black background is the exact one to make this work so well.  Get rid of the funky border - this image does not need it.', '2004-08-03 13:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(839318, 94283, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great selection of apples along with perfect exposure make this image stand out.  My only very small request is to see a bit more of the stem on the left rear apple.  That''s so minor - you still get a high score from me.</td>', 'Great selection of apples along with perfect exposure make this image stand out.  My only very small request is to see a bit more of the stem on the left rear apple.  That''s so minor - you still get a high score from me.', '2004-08-03 13:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(839327, 93652, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have absolutely PERFECT focus and exposure on the grasshopper.   The color of the background is not terribly good - but you didn;''t have much choice.  The small catchlight in the eye is an added treat.  Composition with more space in front and the legs close to the edge is well done.  Black border is about 4 or 5 times to much.  A very thin black border (or none at all) would be better for me.  HAving said all that, it''s a great submission overall.</td>', 'You have absolutely PERFECT focus and exposure on the grasshopper.   The color of the background is not terribly good - but you didn;''t have much choice.  The small catchlight in the eye is an added treat.  Composition with more space in front and the legs close to the edge is well done.  Black border is about 4 or 5 times to much.  A very thin black border (or none at all) would be better for me.  HAving said all that, it''s a great submission overall.', '2004-08-03 14:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(839337, 95003, 19608, '<td valign="top">Really clos-uo for sure.  Great exposure and focus bring out very nice textures throughout.  Well done.</td>', 'Really clos-uo for sure.  Great exposure and focus bring out very nice textures throughout.  Well done.', '2004-08-03 14:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(839341, 94617, 24925, '<td valign="top">First thing that I noticed was the nice green, the second was that it was out of focus.</td>', 'First thing that I noticed was the nice green, the second was that it was out of focus.', '2004-08-03 14:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
