(839425, 94396, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract image with great negative space.</td>', 'Nice abstract image with great negative space.', '2004-08-03 14:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(839426, 93758, 259, '<td valign="top">i wasn''t sure what i was looking at when i first loaded.  i like shots that trick my eye.  nice job.</td>', 'i wasn''t sure what i was looking at when i first loaded.  i like shots that trick my eye.  nice job.', '2004-08-03 14:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(839433, 95220, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well done. I like the diagonal comp. DOF is good but I prefer a sharper focus. Colors provide nice contrast.</td>', 'Well done. I like the diagonal comp. DOF is good but I prefer a sharper focus. Colors provide nice contrast.', '2004-08-03 14:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(839435, 94355, 259, '<td valign="top">nice looking blue</td>', 'nice looking blue', '2004-08-03 14:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(839438, 95269, 259, '<td valign="top">i like the almost panoramic crop.</td>', 'i like the almost panoramic crop.', '2004-08-03 14:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(839446, 95298, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like it but I would probably like it more if the background wasn''t so starkly white and withut feature. It looks like it was shot with a single light over your right sholder. Perhaps a second light to the left or, left and slightly behind, would have increased visible detail on the left of the berry ... which seems to blend together a bit.</td>', 'I like it but I would probably like it more if the background wasn''t so starkly white and withut feature. It looks like it was shot with a single light over your right sholder. Perhaps a second light to the left or, left and slightly behind, would have increased visible detail on the left of the berry ... which seems to blend together a bit.', '2004-08-03 14:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(839447, 95169, 259, '<td valign="top">i really like the dof in your shot.  it feels like i am spying on the bee.  also, the green background works really nicely with the other colors.</td>', 'i really like the dof in your shot.  it feels like i am spying on the bee.  also, the green background works really nicely with the other colors.', '2004-08-03 14:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(839452, 95251, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice. This is a soothing image with terrific composition, colors and contrast.</td>', 'Very nice. This is a soothing image with terrific composition, colors and contrast.', '2004-08-03 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(839457, 95198, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptional macro.  Great idea and puloled out exceptionally well.    Your lighting perfect to allow the spark to retain its color.</td>', 'Exceptional macro.  Great idea and puloled out exceptionally well.    Your lighting perfect to allow the spark to retain its color.', '2004-08-03 14:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(839460, 95057, 259, '<td valign="top">great lighting and compostion.</td>', 'great lighting and compostion.', '2004-08-03 14:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(839465, 95134, 18197, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out where people get these great looking bugs. Our bugs are such schlumps by comparison. But I digress. Nice image. Focus on the wings is great. A bit deeper DOF would have brought the body into focus which would have earned it another point from me.</td>', 'I can''t figure out where people get these great looking bugs. Our bugs are such schlumps by comparison. But I digress. Nice image. Focus on the wings is great. A bit deeper DOF would have brought the body into focus which would have earned it another point from me.', '2004-08-03 14:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(839471, 95118, 18197, '<td valign="top">With this subject, the focus would need to be razor sharp. The soft focus hurts a bit I think.</td>', 'With this subject, the focus would need to be razor sharp. The soft focus hurts a bit I think.', '2004-08-03 14:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(839474, 94564, 259, '<td valign="top">i like how the background brings out the fly</td>', 'i like how the background brings out the fly', '2004-08-03 14:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(839476, 93794, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptional lighting and textures.  Black background is perfect.  I like the fact that the feather has some small imperfections.  Two suggestions for improvement:  1) A more diagonal placement and 2) dump the border.</td>', 'Exceptional lighting and textures.  Black background is perfect.  I like the fact that the feather has some small imperfections.  Two suggestions for improvement:  1) A more diagonal placement and 2) dump the border.', '2004-08-03 14:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(839480, 95032, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. This would have scored higher if it were bigger. It is difficult to appreciate it fully in its current size.  If your camera allows, try for the longest dimension to be at the sight max of 640 pixels.</td>', 'Very nice photo. This would have scored higher if it were bigger. It is difficult to appreciate it fully in its current size.  If your camera allows, try for the longest dimension to be at the sight max of 640 pixels.', '2004-08-03 14:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(839481, 94493, 259, '<td valign="top">nice perspective</td>', 'nice perspective', '2004-08-03 14:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(839485, 95062, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good image, nicely lit and focused. The aspect ratio will take a little getting used to.</td>', 'Good image, nicely lit and focused. The aspect ratio will take a little getting used to.', '2004-08-03 14:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(839488, 95057, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and unique in the challenge. Great work.</td>', 'Beautiful shot and unique in the challenge. Great work.', '2004-08-03 14:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(839494, 94999, 18197, '<td valign="top">I considered a similar shot but in the end rejected the idea. Nicely photographed and technically ver good. I might have tried moving the subject a little to the right or left, but it may not have been possible.</td>', 'I considered a similar shot but in the end rejected the idea. Nicely photographed and technically ver good. I might have tried moving the subject a little to the right or left, but it may not have been possible.', '2004-08-03 14:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(839511, 94364, 259, '<td valign="top">a more colorful bug would give your shot more of a wow factor.  it''s a pretty good shot as it is, but it is dull color-wise because the bug is the same color as the coin.</td>', 'a more colorful bug would give your shot more of a wow factor.  it''s a pretty good shot as it is, but it is dull color-wise because the bug is the same color as the coin.', '2004-08-03 14:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(839515, 94479, 259, '<td valign="top">intersting abstract</td>', 'intersting abstract', '2004-08-03 14:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(839525, 95138, 259, '<td valign="top">i would recommend cloning out the spot on the right.</td>', 'i would recommend cloning out the spot on the right.', '2004-08-03 14:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(839530, 93891, 259, '<td valign="top">nice lighting and composition</td>', 'nice lighting and composition', '2004-08-03 14:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(839538, 95034, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, well captured. I like the way the landscape tilts. Shadows are good and DOF works. Good job.</td>', 'Interesting subject, well captured. I like the way the landscape tilts. Shadows are good and DOF works. Good job.', '2004-08-03 14:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(839550, 94121, 259, '<td valign="top">the way in which you have composed your shot makes it very cluttered looking.  your picture would be much stronger if you composed the shot in such a way that you seperate your subject from the surroundings.</td>', 'the way in which you have composed your shot makes it very cluttered looking.  your picture would be much stronger if you composed the shot in such a way that you seperate your subject from the surroundings.', '2004-08-03 14:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(839555, 95196, 259, '<td valign="top">i might be breaking the trend, but i like the shallow dof.</td>', 'i might be breaking the trend, but i like the shallow dof.', '2004-08-03 14:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(839565, 94930, 259, '<td valign="top">kinda freaky, in a good way.</td>', 'kinda freaky, in a good way.', '2004-08-03 14:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(839571, 94280, 259, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2004-08-03 14:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(839581, 94348, 259, '<td valign="top">i really like the simplicity</td>', 'i really like the simplicity', '2004-08-03 14:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(839591, 95244, 259, '<td valign="top">amazing texture.  very nice b&amp;w, especially for something that usually taken in color.</td>', 'amazing texture.  very nice b&w, especially for something that usually taken in color.', '2004-08-03 15:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(839599, 95302, 259, '<td valign="top">nice abstract.  i like the color and repetition.</td>', 'nice abstract.  i like the color and repetition.', '2004-08-03 15:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(839603, 95298, 259, '<td valign="top">without the splash, the shot would just fall in the mix of the average shots.  the splash makes it more interesting than most shots in the challenge.</td>', 'without the splash, the shot would just fall in the mix of the average shots.  the splash makes it more interesting than most shots in the challenge.', '2004-08-03 15:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(839609, 95245, 259, '<td valign="top">nice textures</td>', 'nice textures', '2004-08-03 15:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(839633, 95118, 259, '<td valign="top">your subject choice isn''t as strong as other shots in the challenge.</td>', 'your subject choice isn''t as strong as other shots in the challenge.', '2004-08-03 15:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(839820, 95298, 23394, '<td valign="top">awesome shot.  composition, lighting, colors--it all works for me.  this is absolutely a killer image...good luck, i hope you score well!</td>', 'awesome shot.  composition, lighting, colors--it all works for me.  this is absolutely a killer image...good luck, i hope you score well!', '2004-08-03 16:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(839827, 95062, 21430, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. I really like the way the background to this image really works with a greyish almost graphite feel. It''s a nice contrast to the pencil yellow.<br/> <br/>  The only thing I have to say is that it looks a little underexposed. It could also be that the Pencil Yellow is darker the brands I am used to.  I like the texture of the wood around the graphite as well.<br/> <br/>   I would like to see this image a little larger, with less of the bottom part of the image and possibly in Black and White. It would be interesting to see the texture of the wood around in the pencil in B&amp;W.</td>', 'This is a great shot. I really like the way the background to this image really works with a greyish almost graphite feel. It''s a nice contrast to the pencil yellow.   The only thing I have to say is that it looks a little underexposed. It could also be that the Pencil Yellow is darker the brands I am used to.  I like the texture of the wood around the graphite as well.    I would like to see this image a little larger, with less of the bottom part of the image and possibly in Black and White. It would be interesting to see the texture of the wood around in the pencil in B&W.', '2004-08-03 16:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(839843, 94677, 8139, '<td valign="top">One of the best flowers so far...</td>', 'One of the best flowers so far...', '2004-08-03 17:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(839898, 95282, 20941, '<td valign="top">i like the colors, but would have preferred to see a less distracting backround.</td>', 'i like the colors, but would have preferred to see a less distracting backround.', '2004-08-03 17:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(839899, 95118, 9982, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Love the blurry low tech effect. Don''t suppose it will score highly but who cares? 10</td>', 'Great idea. Love the blurry low tech effect. Don''t suppose it will score highly but who cares? 10', '2004-08-03 17:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(839908, 94998, 9982, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2004-08-03 17:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(839922, 95158, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea.  Your image has several things going for it including:  Great flat lighting, perfect exposure, nice combination of colors, and nice combination of textures.  On the down side, it lacks a bit on the composition.  One of the  colored peppercorns -  probably a green or red should have been positioned at one of the critical "crash p[oints."  In addition the green and red ones on the top edge should not have been cut in half - but it is quite ok for the really dark ones.  Having said that - it has more good qualities than improvement areas - so nice job!</td>', 'Wonderful idea.  Your image has several things going for it including:  Great flat lighting, perfect exposure, nice combination of colors, and nice combination of textures.  On the down side, it lacks a bit on the composition.  One of the  colored peppercorns -  probably a green or red should have been positioned at one of the critical "crash p[oints."  In addition the green and red ones on the top edge should not have been cut in half - but it is quite ok for the really dark ones.  Having said that - it has more good qualities than improvement areas - so nice job!', '2004-08-03 18:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(839925, 94419, 19608, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Perfect focus on the figure - but somehow you needed to prevent the terrible OOF yellow blob in the foreground.  Good exposure and vibrant colors.</td>', 'Cute.  Perfect focus on the figure - but somehow you needed to prevent the terrible OOF yellow blob in the foreground.  Good exposure and vibrant colors.', '2004-08-03 18:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(839931, 94478, 15134, '<td valign="top">Good idea and naming :)</td>', 'Good idea and naming :)', '2004-08-03 18:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(839933, 94328, 15134, '<td valign="top">deep!</td>', 'deep!', '2004-08-03 18:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(839940, 94355, 19608, '<td valign="top">One of nature''s mort graceful objects for sure.  The shell itself is wonderful but the large white area at the top right is really terribly distracting.  Your multi-layered border is yucko for me.</td>', 'One of nature''s mort graceful objects for sure.  The shell itself is wonderful but the large white area at the top right is really terribly distracting.  Your multi-layered border is yucko for me.', '2004-08-03 18:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(839941, 94349, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice high-key presentation, good lighting and placement.</td>', 'Nice high-key presentation, good lighting and placement.', '2004-08-03 18:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(839993, 95186, 10837, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, this is super cute!!  Reminds me of the photographs that I try to take of my own dog!  Except, I''m not as pro as you are!  The incredible detailed of a dog''s nose is shown here.. superb!  Love it!  It''s like ARTLIST''S COLLECTION: THE DOG .. except even closer!  Hope you know what I mean.. you know those pictures of cute puppies, very close up so they look even cuter!  (It is a company in Japan.)  Anyways, great work!</td>', 'Hahaha, this is super cute!!  Reminds me of the photographs that I try to take of my own dog!  Except, I''m not as pro as you are!  The incredible detailed of a dog''s nose is shown here.. superb!  Love it!  It''s like ARTLIST''S COLLECTION: THE DOG .. except even closer!  Hope you know what I mean.. you know those pictures of cute puppies, very close up so they look even cuter!  (It is a company in Japan.)  Anyways, great work!', '2004-08-03 18:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(840000, 94980, 14476, '<td valign="top">You have framed this image beautifully and brought out the subtle colors without going ''overboard.''  Nice work.</td>', 'You have framed this image beautifully and brought out the subtle colors without going ''overboard.''  Nice work.', '2004-08-03 18:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(840004, 94530, 14476, '<td valign="top">There is a good deal of luminosity to this image along with the fine composition and color.  Good one!</td>', 'There is a good deal of luminosity to this image along with the fine composition and color.  Good one!', '2004-08-03 18:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(840008, 94988, 14476, '<td valign="top">A little fuzzy here and there, but the excellent composition makes up for that.  Love those wings!</td>', 'A little fuzzy here and there, but the excellent composition makes up for that.  Love those wings!', '2004-08-03 18:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(840011, 95318, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good composition and technique on this one!  Looks as if it comes from an alien planet.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Good composition and technique on this one!  Looks as if it comes from an alien planet.  Nicely done.', '2004-08-03 18:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(840016, 94666, 14476, '<td valign="top">I like your placement of the leaves and stem in this nice crisp image and it''s a relief to see something without a bug on it!  (Not that they aren''t interesting)</td>', 'I like your placement of the leaves and stem in this nice crisp image and it''s a relief to see something without a bug on it!  (Not that they aren''t interesting)', '2004-08-03 18:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(840017, 93789, 10263, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I love how they fold their little feet under. Great action freeze</td>', 'Beautiful. I love how they fold their little feet under. Great action freeze', '2004-08-03 18:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(840021, 94988, 10263, '<td valign="top">I wish the focus was on his face rather than the wings. He certainly does have long legs :)</td>', 'I wish the focus was on his face rather than the wings. He certainly does have long legs :)', '2004-08-03 18:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(840022, 93985, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good depiction of this leaf, perhaps would be even better if you could have found a whole leaf to photograph.  The background and soft shadow are effective.</td>', 'Good depiction of this leaf, perhaps would be even better if you could have found a whole leaf to photograph.  The background and soft shadow are effective.', '2004-08-03 18:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(840029, 95179, 14476, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and nice colors, placement in the frame.  Probably would be fun to try different settings to get greater DOF.  Then you could show more of the very pretty shell...</td>', 'Interesting subject and nice colors, placement in the frame.  Probably would be fun to try different settings to get greater DOF.  Then you could show more of the very pretty shell...', '2004-08-03 18:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(840034, 94947, 14476, '<td valign="top">Makes an interesting and effective abstract.  Nice seeing.</td>', 'Makes an interesting and effective abstract.  Nice seeing.', '2004-08-03 18:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(840040, 95246, 14476, '<td valign="top">Stunning interpretation of a water lily.  Very dramatic.  Good one.  Maybe a little soft in the center...  but those petals are exceptional.</td>', 'Stunning interpretation of a water lily.  Very dramatic.  Good one.  Maybe a little soft in the center...  but those petals are exceptional.', '2004-08-03 18:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(840045, 95199, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good capture, but sadly, the butterfly landed on a not-so-goodlooking flower.</td>', 'Good capture, but sadly, the butterfly landed on a not-so-goodlooking flower.', '2004-08-03 18:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(840051, 94677, 14476, '<td valign="top">Flamboyant and striking.  Good composition and great colors.  Maybe a little more DOF would bring out those back leaves.</td>', 'Flamboyant and striking.  Good composition and great colors.  Maybe a little more DOF would bring out those back leaves.', '2004-08-03 18:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(840053, 94228, 9576, '<td valign="top">Is this water ? 10</td>', 'Is this water ? 10', '2004-08-03 18:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(840055, 94076, 14476, '<td valign="top">Another exceptional abstract!  Excellent composition and delicate use of space.  8</td>', 'Another exceptional abstract!  Excellent composition and delicate use of space.  8', '2004-08-03 18:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(840064, 95045, 9576, '<td valign="top">very good 10</td>', 'very good 10', '2004-08-03 18:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(840069, 94463, 9576, '<td valign="top">Great job 10</td>', 'Great job 10', '2004-08-03 18:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(840075, 95042, 9576, '<td valign="top">much to small would have made a good one if it ware bigger</td>', 'much to small would have made a good one if it ware bigger', '2004-08-03 19:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(840084, 93797, 9576, '<td valign="top">wery good macro 10</td>', 'wery good macro 10', '2004-08-03 19:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(840102, 94531, 12674, '<td valign="top">Very crisp seam that almost looks like a smile.  I lose edge of ball with red background but maybe you were trying for this effect.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Very crisp seam that almost looks like a smile.  I lose edge of ball with red background but maybe you were trying for this effect.  Nice shot.', '2004-08-03 19:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(840121, 93797, 10263, '<td valign="top">Wow, I had no idea a dragon fly had lips. You already know this is like blow-me-out-of-the-water good. About all I can do is repeat my wow.</td>', 'Wow, I had no idea a dragon fly had lips. You already know this is like blow-me-out-of-the-water good. About all I can do is repeat my wow.', '2004-08-03 19:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(840122, 94865, 17134, '<td valign="top">The red draws the attention to too many places.. a green one would''ve done better<br/>Don''t like the border :)</td>', 'The red draws the attention to too many places.. a green one would''ve done betterDon''t like the border :)', '2004-08-03 19:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(840129, 94624, 10263, '<td valign="top">Must be the Atkins Diet. The bee doesn''t stand out enough against the dark flower. But then I know how hard it is to find a good bug photo opportunity. Good luck :)</td>', 'Must be the Atkins Diet. The bee doesn''t stand out enough against the dark flower. But then I know how hard it is to find a good bug photo opportunity. Good luck :)', '2004-08-03 19:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(840130, 94355, 24435, '<td valign="top">this is GREAT</td>', 'this is GREAT', '2004-08-03 19:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
