(840569, 95138, 18197, '<td valign="top">This made me smile. Good photo and a sense of humor. Focus is spot on. Exposure is good. Nice choice for DOF. Thanks.</td>', 'This made me smile. Good photo and a sense of humor. Focus is spot on. Exposure is good. Nice choice for DOF. Thanks.', '2004-08-03 23:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(840571, 94955, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract composition.Focus is vry good. Abit more differentiated saturation between grass and leaves would have helped the sense of depth.</td>', 'Nice abstract composition.Focus is vry good. Abit more differentiated saturation between grass and leaves would have helped the sense of depth.', '2004-08-03 23:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(840572, 95088, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo done in with a great technology-style technique. Focus is terrific. Lighting is very good but it might benefit from a side light or two. Nicely fills the frame. Really, this is exceptionally good.</td>', 'This is a very nice photo done in with a great technology-style technique. Focus is terrific. Lighting is very good but it might benefit from a side light or two. Nicely fills the frame. Really, this is exceptionally good.', '2004-08-03 23:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(840574, 94492, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good concept and composition. Improved focus would get a couple of more points from me.</td>', 'Good concept and composition. Improved focus would get a couple of more points from me.', '2004-08-03 23:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(840576, 94009, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower beautifully captured. The only thing I can think of to improve is a bit more contrast. otherwise, virtually perfect.</td>', 'Beautiful flower beautifully captured. The only thing I can think of to improve is a bit more contrast. otherwise, virtually perfect.', '2004-08-03 23:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(840577, 94773, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love the picture. Lose the tongue.</td>', 'Love the picture. Lose the tongue.', '2004-08-03 23:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(840579, 95168, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great photo of the rose petals. Not so great background. In this case I would suggest PS to tune up the background or a different crop to de-emphasize it.</td>', 'Great photo of the rose petals. Not so great background. In this case I would suggest PS to tune up the background or a different crop to de-emphasize it.', '2004-08-03 23:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(840582, 94980, 18197, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. I love high contrast photos and bark is one of the very best subjects. Very nicly captures the subject. Focus, colors, DOF, levels ... everything is spot on and the comp is pleasing. One of this crop''s best.</td>', 'Excellent photo. I love high contrast photos and bark is one of the very best subjects. Very nicly captures the subject. Focus, colors, DOF, levels ... everything is spot on and the comp is pleasing. One of this crop''s best.', '2004-08-03 23:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(840584, 95272, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good workmanlike image technically but the subject falls short for me. If you can take your mastery of camera and composition and apply it to a more worthy subject, your photos will do great!</td>', 'Good workmanlike image technically but the subject falls short for me. If you can take your mastery of camera and composition and apply it to a more worthy subject, your photos will do great!', '2004-08-03 23:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(840586, 94037, 18197, '<td valign="top">There is some doubt in my mind what the subject is ... Bug or Flower. The petals are the most accurately focused. My suggestion would be to be sure your intended subject is most accurately focused. Otherwise a very nice capture with good colors, comp, levels and contrast. Blurred background via DOF works well.</td>', 'There is some doubt in my mind what the subject is ... Bug or Flower. The petals are the most accurately focused. My suggestion would be to be sure your intended subject is most accurately focused. Otherwise a very nice capture with good colors, comp, levels and contrast. Blurred background via DOF works well.', '2004-08-03 23:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(840588, 95241, 18197, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic photo. Great subject, high degree of difficulty, well lighted. One of this challenge''s best. I expect it to ribbon.</td>', 'What a fantastic photo. Great subject, high degree of difficulty, well lighted. One of this challenge''s best. I expect it to ribbon.', '2004-08-03 23:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(840589, 94328, 18197, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to critique this beautiful capture. The only thing that bothers me and only a little is the whites on the left are a bit blown out and the subject is a bit too centered for my taste. If you cropped about 10% from the left of the image, it might be better.</td>', 'It''s hard to critique this beautiful capture. The only thing that bothers me and only a little is the whites on the left are a bit blown out and the subject is a bit too centered for my taste. If you cropped about 10% from the left of the image, it might be better.', '2004-08-03 23:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(840591, 94735, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract image with pleasing contrast and colors. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice abstract image with pleasing contrast and colors. Well done.', '2004-08-03 23:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(840592, 94401, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good composition but flat light and minor focus problems detract a bit. It does a good job of conveying emotion but it may just be anthropomorphic.</td>', 'Good composition but flat light and minor focus problems detract a bit. It does a good job of conveying emotion but it may just be anthropomorphic.', '2004-08-03 23:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(840593, 95186, 18197, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t resonate much with this image. It DID however, make me smile. Thanks.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t resonate much with this image. It DID however, make me smile. Thanks.', '2004-08-03 23:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(840597, 95164, 18197, '<td valign="top">Strongest aspect of this image for me is the use of negative space. Good job with that. Focus, exposure and levels are fine. DOF is fine. Subject, for me, is weak.</td>', 'Strongest aspect of this image for me is the use of negative space. Good job with that. Focus, exposure and levels are fine. DOF is fine. Subject, for me, is weak.', '2004-08-03 23:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(840598, 94445, 19446, '<td valign="top">the blue &amp; yellow work great toghether.</td>', 'the blue & yellow work great toghether.', '2004-08-03 23:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(840599, 94866, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very very nice capture. Love the high contrast. Negative space is wonderful. Lighting superb. There is (an unintended) pun here. Step back and it looks like a shot of a bird, possibly a parrot or some such. I like the duality of that.</td>', 'Very very nice capture. Love the high contrast. Negative space is wonderful. Lighting superb. There is (an unintended) pun here. Step back and it looks like a shot of a bird, possibly a parrot or some such. I like the duality of that.', '2004-08-03 23:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(840602, 93778, 18197, '<td valign="top">Yet another (great) bug shot. Well captured, focused, exposed, ... I might have cloned out the dark spot above the wing which detracts a bit.</td>', 'Yet another (great) bug shot. Well captured, focused, exposed, ... I might have cloned out the dark spot above the wing which detracts a bit.', '2004-08-03 23:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(840605, 95073, 19446, '<td valign="top">The colors are excelent.  I *might* have gone w/ a deeper DOF.  I really like that this isn''t a perfect flower.  Of all flower shots, I love ones that show blemishes and imperfectoins.</td>', 'The colors are excelent.  I *might* have gone w/ a deeper DOF.  I really like that this isn''t a perfect flower.  Of all flower shots, I love ones that show blemishes and imperfectoins.', '2004-08-03 23:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(840606, 93801, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice image that convey deep emotions. I like the colors and contrast. Nice use of negative space. However the image is a bit noisy and doesn''t feel like a macro shot to me. If you cropped it to include the bottom 60% of the image, and used something like Neat Image to reduce the noise, I think it might be better and still convey the emotion.</td>', 'Nice image that convey deep emotions. I like the colors and contrast. Nice use of negative space. However the image is a bit noisy and doesn''t feel like a macro shot to me. If you cropped it to include the bottom 60% of the image, and used something like Neat Image to reduce the noise, I think it might be better and still convey the emotion.', '2004-08-04 00:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(840607, 94753, 19446, '<td valign="top">The runner up I was going to enter was a portrait of Lincoln.  Good job, I happen to like the shallower DOF on this.</td>', 'The runner up I was going to enter was a portrait of Lincoln.  Good job, I happen to like the shallower DOF on this.', '2004-08-04 00:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(840611, 94769, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great image. Nice balance. Focus and colors are spot on. Nicely done without bugs or flowers.</td>', 'Great image. Nice balance. Focus and colors are spot on. Nicely done without bugs or flowers.', '2004-08-04 00:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(840616, 94355, 18197, '<td valign="top">Brilliant photo. This feels like a ribbon to me. I can find much to praise and nothing but nit picky minor things to nag about. It''s such a beautiful image, I''ll resist the temptation and only wish you well in the scoring.</td>', 'Brilliant photo. This feels like a ribbon to me. I can find much to praise and nothing but nit picky minor things to nag about. It''s such a beautiful image, I''ll resist the temptation and only wish you well in the scoring.', '2004-08-04 00:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(840621, 95338, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am sure this was not simple to shoot or post process. Superb in evry way but the crop which feels a bit to centered for my eye. Still nicely done.</td>', 'I am sure this was not simple to shoot or post process. Superb in evry way but the crop which feels a bit to centered for my eye. Still nicely done.', '2004-08-04 00:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(840623, 95072, 18197, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful capture. Among the best of the bugs.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful capture. Among the best of the bugs.', '2004-08-04 00:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(840625, 93794, 18197, '<td valign="top">The strongest element of this for me is the brilliant use of negative space. Everything else is technically superb. Hope it does well.</td>', 'The strongest element of this for me is the brilliant use of negative space. Everything else is technically superb. Hope it does well.', '2004-08-04 00:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(840632, 93985, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice subject well captured. For my taste, a bit too much background and a bit too little subject. White on the left is blown out. if you backed off on brightness a bit, would you still have had texture in the background on the left?</td>', 'Nice subject well captured. For my taste, a bit too much background and a bit too little subject. White on the left is blown out. if you backed off on brightness a bit, would you still have had texture in the background on the left?', '2004-08-04 00:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(840635, 94875, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is interesting. The quality of the capture is so good it reveals something of the structure of the feather I never realized before.  Thanks. Hope it does well.</td>', 'This is interesting. The quality of the capture is so good it reveals something of the structure of the feather I never realized before.  Thanks. Hope it does well.', '2004-08-04 00:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(840640, 95003, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am afraid I''ll have nightmares about this little guy. Good capture, focus, DOF, color, ... Hope it does well.</td>', 'I am afraid I''ll have nightmares about this little guy. Good capture, focus, DOF, color, ... Hope it does well.', '2004-08-04 00:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(840644, 93883, 18197, '<td valign="top">Another fantastic bug shot. this seems like the very best capture of translucent wings. Great job.</td>', 'Another fantastic bug shot. this seems like the very best capture of translucent wings. Great job.', '2004-08-04 00:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(840648, 94928, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a good workmanlike image but it feels flat and lifeless. I think multiple light sources and some shadowing would have helped.</td>', 'This is a good workmanlike image but it feels flat and lifeless. I think multiple light sources and some shadowing would have helped.', '2004-08-04 00:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(840652, 95238, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good capture but doesn''t feel like a macro shot to me. Suggest getting a lot closer to something in the frame and making it the hyper-focused subject.</td>', 'Good capture but doesn''t feel like a macro shot to me. Suggest getting a lot closer to something in the frame and making it the hyper-focused subject.', '2004-08-04 00:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
