(840664, 93758, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good subject well lighted and captured. It''s too bad the competition is so tough in the challenge. I fear this won''t do as well as it deserves in the voting. With your obvious mastery of camera and comp, I expect to see a lot of good images from you.</td>', 'Good subject well lighted and captured. It''s too bad the competition is so tough in the challenge. I fear this won''t do as well as it deserves in the voting. With your obvious mastery of camera and comp, I expect to see a lot of good images from you.', '2004-08-04 00:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(840668, 94283, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the comp and negative space a lot. This would be more appealing to me to see some reflection on the fruit. This would add depth to the image and add interest to the subject.</td>', 'I like the comp and negative space a lot. This would be more appealing to me to see some reflection on the fruit. This would add depth to the image and add interest to the subject.', '2004-08-04 00:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
