(841480, 94818, 4008, '<td valign="top">Composition does not work for me. The small leave sticking forward towards the camera is confusing and it hides one of the ants. There is also too much going on and to much empty spcae around the scene, a slightly closer and different viewpoint might have solved it.</td>', 'Composition does not work for me. The small leave sticking forward towards the camera is confusing and it hides one of the ants. There is also too much going on and to much empty spcae around the scene, a slightly closer and different viewpoint might have solved it.', '2004-08-04 07:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
