(841691, 94467, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  tad over-exposed.  did you use a flash?  did you use a tripod?  if you get a chance, try shooting this from an angle that includes more of the zig-zag part of the web, and also without as busy a background.  these spiders have incredible colors, and don''t seem to mind your getting up close.</td>', 'nice shot.  tad over-exposed.  did you use a flash?  did you use a tripod?  if you get a chance, try shooting this from an angle that includes more of the zig-zag part of the web, and also without as busy a background.  these spiders have incredible colors, and don''t seem to mind your getting up close.', '2004-08-04 10:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(841693, 94220, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  would like it a little less centered and with more reflection.  i know it can be tough to get close without falling in (unless you are using a zoom/telephoto).  the greenery is somewhat distracting...maybe try a different cropping?</td>', 'nice shot.  would like it a little less centered and with more reflection.  i know it can be tough to get close without falling in (unless you are using a zoom/telephoto).  the greenery is somewhat distracting...maybe try a different cropping?', '2004-08-04 10:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(841696, 94121, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice effort, but unfortunately for me, it''s not working too well.  too much blue and too much busy background.</td>', 'nice effort, but unfortunately for me, it''s not working too well.  too much blue and too much busy background.', '2004-08-04 10:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(841700, 94493, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice effort, but for me, unfortunately, it''s not working too well.  the lashes are just too fine to command star-billing.  maybe from a different angle?</td>', 'nice effort, but for me, unfortunately, it''s not working too well.  the lashes are just too fine to command star-billing.  maybe from a different angle?', '2004-08-04 10:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(841706, 94769, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice target, unfortunately, a bit out of focus.  there is potential here, but you''d need to work on the lighting hitting the nail.</td>', 'nice target, unfortunately, a bit out of focus.  there is potential here, but you''d need to work on the lighting hitting the nail.', '2004-08-04 10:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(841714, 95196, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice effort.  this is a tough shot, especially when working with live models...my best advice:  take lots and lots and lots of shots, ever so slighting adjusting the focus.  this would be killer if the focus wasn''t so soft.  (also, i can''t tell for sure, but you might need to clean your sensor; i think i''m seeing a couple of spots that usually only show up when there''s dust on the sensor.)</td>', 'nice effort.  this is a tough shot, especially when working with live models...my best advice:  take lots and lots and lots of shots, ever so slighting adjusting the focus.  this would be killer if the focus wasn''t so soft.  (also, i can''t tell for sure, but you might need to clean your sensor; i think i''m seeing a couple of spots that usually only show up when there''s dust on the sensor.)', '2004-08-04 10:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(841727, 94828, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice effort, but unfortunately, it doesn''t work for me.  i''ve taken a ton of these pictures, thinking that it was an opportunity i didn''t want to miss, only to say to myself later, ''damn, that background just doesn''t work'' or ''damn, my focus just missed.''  and then i say, ''oh well, maybe next time.'' and i go out in the yard on my hands and knees, looking for more creepy crawly things...good luck!</td>', 'nice effort, but unfortunately, it doesn''t work for me.  i''ve taken a ton of these pictures, thinking that it was an opportunity i didn''t want to miss, only to say to myself later, ''damn, that background just doesn''t work'' or ''damn, my focus just missed.''  and then i say, ''oh well, maybe next time.'' and i go out in the yard on my hands and knees, looking for more creepy crawly things...good luck!', '2004-08-04 10:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(841738, 94773, 23394, '<td valign="top">ay-yi-yi!  i think i''d like it more without the tongue (or with the tongue in focus).</td>', 'ay-yi-yi!  i think i''d like it more without the tongue (or with the tongue in focus).', '2004-08-04 11:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
