(841753, 94547, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice effort.  wish it was a little sharper and that the bottom tip wasn''t cropped out.  personally, i think shallow dof is fine, as long as the point closest to the lense is what is in focus (i just don''t like blurry foregrounds).</td>', 'nice effort.  wish it was a little sharper and that the bottom tip wasn''t cropped out.  personally, i think shallow dof is fine, as long as the point closest to the lense is what is in focus (i just don''t like blurry foregrounds).', '2004-08-04 11:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
