(842483, 95167, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good photo and comp. A bit dark. A little noisy. Focus is excellent. Great DOF. Subject doesn''t do much for me but it''s going to be a matter of taste.</td>', 'Good photo and comp. A bit dark. A little noisy. Focus is excellent. Great DOF. Subject doesn''t do much for me but it''s going to be a matter of taste.', '2004-08-04 15:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
