(842520, 94586, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice subject (imagine a flower AND a bug in one image). Comp is fine. Capture is fine. But it doesn''t stand out from the croud.</td>', 'Nice subject (imagine a flower AND a bug in one image). Comp is fine. Capture is fine. But it doesn''t stand out from the croud.', '2004-08-04 16:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
