(842539, 93840, 18197, '<td valign="top">Arguably the best techno-macro shot inthe challenge. Just superb.  My only suggestion and it''s pretty nit picky, would be to use just a bit more USM. This may well ribbon and should be among top tem from my perspective.</td>', 'Arguably the best techno-macro shot inthe challenge. Just superb.  My only suggestion and it''s pretty nit picky, would be to use just a bit more USM. This may well ribbon and should be among top tem from my perspective.', '2004-08-04 16:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(842559, 94554, 21430, '<td valign="top">All I can about this is "eeeeww"<br/> <br/>It is a nice example of a Macro shot, but is is wholly unappealing as a finished product.</td>', 'All I can about this is "eeeeww" It is a nice example of a Macro shot, but is is wholly unappealing as a finished product.', '2004-08-04 16:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(842567, 94859, 18197, '<td valign="top">Composition is strong enough but colors need a bit of work, at least when viewed on my monitor. Looks more like Corona than Champagne. Wonder if you are working in sRGB color space on your PC. If not, they may have shifted.</td>', 'Composition is strong enough but colors need a bit of work, at least when viewed on my monitor. Looks more like Corona than Champagne. Wonder if you are working in sRGB color space on your PC. If not, they may have shifted.', '2004-08-04 16:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(842568, 95225, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very colorful image. I can see this hanging up in a gradeschoold classrom with a motivational message below it. I think it could be quite successful commercially. All the mechanica are good. Well done.</td>', 'Very colorful image. I can see this hanging up in a gradeschoold classrom with a motivational message below it. I think it could be quite successful commercially. All the mechanica are good. Well done.', '2004-08-04 16:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(842570, 94511, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great idea and title. It would be better if the focus on the bug were sharper and if the bug was a bit more differentiated from the leaf behind.  That might have been possibly with different lighting. Good job.</td>', 'Great idea and title. It would be better if the focus on the bug were sharper and if the bug was a bit more differentiated from the leaf behind.  That might have been possibly with different lighting. Good job.', '2004-08-04 16:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(842574, 94456, 18197, '<td valign="top">Thanks you for the non-stereotypical image. (not a bug, not a flower) I like a lot of the aspects of this but would have liked it a bit better with greater DOF I think.</td>', 'Thanks you for the non-stereotypical image. (not a bug, not a flower) I like a lot of the aspects of this but would have liked it a bit better with greater DOF I think.', '2004-08-04 16:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(842577, 95229, 21430, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. I could almost see this hanging on a wall. I really like the way that the lighting hits these musthrooms. <br/> <br/>   The angle is also very cool. It lends the idea that this is a picture of a giant mushroom forest.</td>', 'Very nice capture. I could almost see this hanging on a wall. I really like the way that the lighting hits these musthrooms.     The angle is also very cool. It lends the idea that this is a picture of a giant mushroom forest.', '2004-08-04 16:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(842579, 95282, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting compositionally. Good colors. Possibly a bit too brightly lit. Would benefit from multiple light sources i think.</td>', 'Interesting compositionally. Good colors. Possibly a bit too brightly lit. Would benefit from multiple light sources i think.', '2004-08-04 16:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(842580, 94432, 21430, '<td valign="top">It''s a good concept and a nice example of macro. However, the image doesn''t jump out and get me so to speak. It''s a little bland.</td>', 'It''s a good concept and a nice example of macro. However, the image doesn''t jump out and get me so to speak. It''s a little bland.', '2004-08-04 16:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(842581, 94390, 18197, '<td valign="top">I did not expect to like this when I viewed the thumbnail, but something about the shadow attracted me. This is really a superb image. The overal composition and teh shadow are the strongest features which I might have tried to accentuate a bit. Well focused. good DOF. If it were my image, I might have tried for a bit darker shadow.</td>', 'I did not expect to like this when I viewed the thumbnail, but something about the shadow attracted me. This is really a superb image. The overal composition and teh shadow are the strongest features which I might have tried to accentuate a bit. Well focused. good DOF. If it were my image, I might have tried for a bit darker shadow.', '2004-08-04 16:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(842583, 94465, 18197, '<td valign="top">The mechanics of the photo are very good. The subject matter pulls it to the middle of the bug pack for me.</td>', 'The mechanics of the photo are very good. The subject matter pulls it to the middle of the bug pack for me.', '2004-08-04 16:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(842597, 93797, 24679, '<td valign="top">Now that is macro!</td>', 'Now that is macro!', '2004-08-04 16:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(842599, 94228, 24679, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot!</td>', 'wonderful shot!', '2004-08-04 16:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(842664, 94655, 18197, '<td valign="top">Gotta say this is creepy. I''m going to have nightmares about this. Great emotive image, well shot.</td>', 'Gotta say this is creepy. I''m going to have nightmares about this. Great emotive image, well shot.', '2004-08-04 17:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(842666, 94398, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great shot in a herd of other great bee shots. Probably 70th percentile of genre. A bit sharper focus on teh bee would have raised it for me.</td>', 'Great shot in a herd of other great bee shots. Probably 70th percentile of genre. A bit sharper focus on teh bee would have raised it for me.', '2004-08-04 17:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(842672, 95239, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Thanks for the non-stereotypical image. Focus, colors and reflections make this image dance. Black background works well. I am normally not a fan of borders but this one would be an exception.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Thanks for the non-stereotypical image. Focus, colors and reflections make this image dance. Black background works well. I am normally not a fan of borders but this one would be an exception.', '2004-08-04 17:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(842682, 94029, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good technically competent image. The subject isn''t as interesting to me as others have been, but hard to find fault otherwise. Hope you apply your obvious mastery of camera and comp to future challenges.</td>', 'Good technically competent image. The subject isn''t as interesting to me as others have been, but hard to find fault otherwise. Hope you apply your obvious mastery of camera and comp to future challenges.', '2004-08-04 17:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(842687, 94463, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good abstract image which appeals to my sense of balance. Beautiful reflections. I like the repetitive pattern. Highlights along the edges of the wood are very nice but seem a little pixelated. Could we see a bit more of the grain of the wood?</td>', 'Good abstract image which appeals to my sense of balance. Beautiful reflections. I like the repetitive pattern. Highlights along the edges of the wood are very nice but seem a little pixelated. Could we see a bit more of the grain of the wood?', '2004-08-04 17:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(842694, 94930, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well captured but the subject doesn''t resonate with me that much.</td>', 'Well captured but the subject doesn''t resonate with me that much.', '2004-08-04 17:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(842697, 94595, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast, sharply focused style of the picture. Interesting negative space.</td>', 'I like the high contrast, sharply focused style of the picture. Interesting negative space.', '2004-08-04 17:34:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(842700, 94047, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Hard to find much to citicize. Focus on subject flower is perfect. Lighting is very very good. Slightly shallower DOF might have blurred background a bit more and improve it slightly. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice. Hard to find much to citicize. Focus on subject flower is perfect. Lighting is very very good. Slightly shallower DOF might have blurred background a bit more and improve it slightly. Well done.', '2004-08-04 17:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(842703, 94512, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. A nearly perfect capture of a well composed subject.</td>', 'Nice shot. A nearly perfect capture of a well composed subject.', '2004-08-04 17:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(842709, 95232, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well, Barbie, it''s a non-stereotypical image. Thanks for some relief from bugs and flowers. It''s well focused. Interesting DOF</td>', 'Well, Barbie, it''s a non-stereotypical image. Thanks for some relief from bugs and flowers. It''s well focused. Interesting DOF', '2004-08-04 17:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(842714, 95170, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, well captured and composed. Not quite the wow factor of some of the other bugs but there is some really strong competition out there. Good job.</td>', 'Interesting subject, well captured and composed. Not quite the wow factor of some of the other bugs but there is some really strong competition out there. Good job.', '2004-08-04 17:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(842733, 94624, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I think I would like it better if the underside of the flower were a bit more brightly lit. A bit deeper DOF would have broght entire bee into focus.</td>', 'Nice shot. I think I would like it better if the underside of the flower were a bit more brightly lit. A bit deeper DOF would have broght entire bee into focus.', '2004-08-04 17:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(842738, 94947, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract image. I like DOF effect on Microsoft logo, but shallow DOF on flower hurts overll effect I think.</td>', 'Interesting abstract image. I like DOF effect on Microsoft logo, but shallow DOF on flower hurts overll effect I think.', '2004-08-04 17:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(842740, 94231, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good composition, colors and lighting. Focus needs some work. I can''t really find anything sharply focused. Maybe a bit more USM would have helped.</td>', 'Good composition, colors and lighting. Focus needs some work. I can''t really find anything sharply focused. Maybe a bit more USM would have helped.', '2004-08-04 17:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(842746, 94481, 18197, '<td valign="top">Outstanding! I like the 3 zones of the photo: Wings; Background; and flowers. Comp is good. DOF is terrific! Colors (except the bug) make my teeth hurt a bit. Maybe just a bit oversaturated.</td>', 'Outstanding! I like the 3 zones of the photo: Wings; Background; and flowers. Comp is good. DOF is terrific! Colors (except the bug) make my teeth hurt a bit. Maybe just a bit oversaturated.', '2004-08-04 17:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(842814, 95170, 13610, '<td valign="top">a little more contrast and saturation would improve this shot a lot. Composition is good. (6)</td>', 'a little more contrast and saturation would improve this shot a lot. Composition is good. (6)', '2004-08-04 18:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(842817, 95170, 8643, '<td valign="top">Beautifully crisp, perfect DoF, lovely detail, soft background - great!</td>', 'Beautifully crisp, perfect DoF, lovely detail, soft background - great!', '2004-08-04 18:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(842818, 94859, 13610, '<td valign="top">That is looking awesome, Don''t look like a macro to me but i''d sure like to make one like this (7)</td>', 'That is looking awesome, Don''t look like a macro to me but i''d sure like to make one like this (7)', '2004-08-04 18:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(842850, 94617, 21430, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot. I like the shades of green. It has good DOF. I don''t think that there is anything that I would change in this photo.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot. I like the shades of green. It has good DOF. I don''t think that there is anything that I would change in this photo.', '2004-08-04 18:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(842851, 95244, 21430, '<td valign="top">NIce choice of black and white. The textures come out very nicely in this image.</td>', 'NIce choice of black and white. The textures come out very nicely in this image.', '2004-08-04 18:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(842862, 95102, 13610, '<td valign="top">More contrast and more DOF would help a lot.</td>', 'More contrast and more DOF would help a lot.', '2004-08-04 18:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(842868, 94392, 20115, '<td valign="top">scary</td>', 'scary', '2004-08-04 18:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(842872, 95313, 20115, '<td valign="top">ekkkkkk!</td>', 'ekkkkkk!', '2004-08-04 18:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(842878, 94818, 20115, '<td valign="top">oooo...ekkkk....!</td>', 'oooo...ekkkk....!', '2004-08-04 18:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(842888, 94492, 13610, '<td valign="top">Not enough object in focus. You should try to crop that one with the bee lower and more to the left.</td>', 'Not enough object in focus. You should try to crop that one with the bee lower and more to the left.', '2004-08-04 18:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(842890, 93789, 20115, '<td valign="top">Wow--a very difficult shot to get.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Wow--a very difficult shot to get.  Congratulations!', '2004-08-04 18:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(842911, 94493, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the angle and the individuality of the whiskers and eyelashes. Great shot.</td>', 'I love the angle and the individuality of the whiskers and eyelashes. Great shot.', '2004-08-04 19:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(842940, 95329, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of this image and the strong shadows. If the focus on the white balls were a bit sharper and perhaps you worked in some reflections, this would really pop. Good job.</td>', 'I like the contrast of this image and the strong shadows. If the focus on the white balls were a bit sharper and perhaps you worked in some reflections, this would really pop. Good job.', '2004-08-04 19:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(842942, 95009, 18197, '<td valign="top">Yet another B image ... and a good one at that. I like the sharp focus and great colors. It''s hard to criticize or find an improvement to suggest. Well done. Among the best of the Bee genre.</td>', 'Yet another B image ... and a good one at that. I like the sharp focus and great colors. It''s hard to criticize or find an improvement to suggest. Well done. Among the best of the Bee genre.', '2004-08-04 19:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(842946, 94592, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that this isn''t a perfect flower. Nature isn''t perfect. Life isn''t perfect. This is a very nice image that conveys beauty embracing imperfection. Thanks.</td>', 'I like the fact that this isn''t a perfect flower. Nature isn''t perfect. Life isn''t perfect. This is a very nice image that conveys beauty embracing imperfection. Thanks.', '2004-08-04 19:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(842951, 95187, 18197, '<td valign="top">Neat image. The negative space here is great and really gives a 3 dimensionality I like. Moth is a little busy, but what can you do? Tell it to clean up a bit? LOL Seriously. Nice image well captured.</td>', 'Neat image. The negative space here is great and really gives a 3 dimensionality I like. Moth is a little busy, but what can you do? Tell it to clean up a bit? LOL Seriously. Nice image well captured.', '2004-08-04 19:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(842952, 94405, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice techno-mechanical image. Well focused, well exposed. The subject isn''t as interesting to me as some others but it is hard to find fault with the execution.</td>', 'Nice techno-mechanical image. Well focused, well exposed. The subject isn''t as interesting to me as some others but it is hard to find fault with the execution.', '2004-08-04 19:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(842956, 94348, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love this! The pod and the peas are perfect (exposure, focus, color, lighting, DOF, ...) The background is a little grainy and shows some artifacts of burning I think. There is a little haloing around the pod. All in --- one of my top picks.</td>', 'Love this! The pod and the peas are perfect (exposure, focus, color, lighting, DOF, ...) The background is a little grainy and shows some artifacts of burning I think. There is a little haloing around the pod. All in --- one of my top picks.', '2004-08-04 19:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(842959, 94617, 18197, '<td valign="top">Cool!<br/> <br/>I really like the non-traditional composition. I like all the rest too, but the comp is one of the strongest features of this photo. Well done.</td>', 'Cool! I really like the non-traditional composition. I like all the rest too, but the comp is one of the strongest features of this photo. Well done.', '2004-08-04 19:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(842962, 94386, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic image. I like the dramatic contrast. Colors add to the sense of mystery. Detail in the eye is wonderful -- evidence of careful focus, lighting and DOF. GREAT capture.</td>', 'Very dramatic image. I like the dramatic contrast. Colors add to the sense of mystery. Detail in the eye is wonderful -- evidence of careful focus, lighting and DOF. GREAT capture.', '2004-08-04 19:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(842963, 94196, 18197, '<td valign="top">When I first looked at this, I didn''t think I liked the soft focus but on reflection it really seems to work. good job.</td>', 'When I first looked at this, I didn''t think I liked the soft focus but on reflection it really seems to work. good job.', '2004-08-04 19:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(842965, 95269, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice image, well focused and captured. It is not as dramatic and another image with a similar subject.  Desaturation may be part of the difference. composition may be another.</td>', 'Nice image, well focused and captured. It is not as dramatic and another image with a similar subject.  Desaturation may be part of the difference. composition may be another.', '2004-08-04 19:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(842971, 94938, 18197, '<td valign="top">Dramatic colors and lighting. For my taste, the DOF may be a bit shallow. And I am not normally a fan of a centered composition, but maybe in this case it would have worked. But then you would have received a bunch of "rule of thirds" comments. Can''t win I guess.</td>', 'Dramatic colors and lighting. For my taste, the DOF may be a bit shallow. And I am not normally a fan of a centered composition, but maybe in this case it would have worked. But then you would have received a bunch of "rule of thirds" comments. Can''t win I guess.', '2004-08-04 19:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(842972, 93723, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great image (for a bug). Color, focus, DOF, ... all virrtually perfect. Top third of the bug genre.</td>', 'Great image (for a bug). Color, focus, DOF, ... all virrtually perfect. Top third of the bug genre.', '2004-08-04 19:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(842974, 93797, 18197, '<td valign="top">I never realized bugs had whiskers. How cool is that?<br/> <br/>Nice capture. contrast is what really sets this off for me, and the associated reflections. Just a great great shot. How in the heck did you get it to stand still?</td>', 'I never realized bugs had whiskers. How cool is that? Nice capture. contrast is what really sets this off for me, and the associated reflections. Just a great great shot. How in the heck did you get it to stand still?', '2004-08-04 19:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(842976, 93659, 18197, '<td valign="top">Dramatic contrast ands colors. Very nice focus on the head. DOF works well. Very very nice.</td>', 'Dramatic contrast ands colors. Very nice focus on the head. DOF works well. Very very nice.', '2004-08-04 19:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(842977, 94531, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well shot, mechanically perfect photo. Not sure how I feel about the background blending in with the ball.</td>', 'Well shot, mechanically perfect photo. Not sure how I feel about the background blending in with the ball.', '2004-08-04 19:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(842981, 95323, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good workmanlike bug pic. Feels about middle of the pack for this genre. I lose the wings against the background. there is wonderful detail there. Against a bright background, it would have been more dramatic. Good luck.</td>', 'Good workmanlike bug pic. Feels about middle of the pack for this genre. I lose the wings against the background. there is wonderful detail there. Against a bright background, it would have been more dramatic. Good luck.', '2004-08-04 19:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(842984, 94314, 18197, '<td valign="top">Neat butter fly. Contrast in the wings is dramatic. DOF appropriately blurrs the background. It looks to me like the focus is just barely off on the bug though.</td>', 'Neat butter fly. Contrast in the wings is dramatic. DOF appropriately blurrs the background. It looks to me like the focus is just barely off on the bug though.', '2004-08-04 19:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(842987, 95198, 20375, '<td valign="top">I''m picking this to ribbon! Excellent job!<br/>I gotta know how you fired that plug!</td>', 'I''m picking this to ribbon! Excellent job!I gotta know how you fired that plug!', '2004-08-04 19:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(842988, 94935, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good catch. Bet it was hard to get this guy to stand still.Nice lighting, focus and DOF.</td>', 'Good catch. Bet it was hard to get this guy to stand still.Nice lighting, focus and DOF.', '2004-08-04 19:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(842991, 95326, 20375, '<td valign="top">TEXTURE. This is an awesome example of how texture and colour can make a<br/>very appealing image. I love this shot. I hope others do too. I''m picking it for top ten.<br/>Enjoy your ribbon.</td>', 'TEXTURE. This is an awesome example of how texture and colour can make avery appealing image. I love this shot. I hope others do too. I''m picking it for top ten.Enjoy your ribbon.', '2004-08-04 19:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(842994, 95186, 20375, '<td valign="top">Great shot here. Excellent perspective!<br/>Top ten no problem......hoping it ribbons.</td>', 'Great shot here. Excellent perspective!Top ten no problem......hoping it ribbons.', '2004-08-04 19:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(842997, 94987, 18197, '<td valign="top">Is a snail a bug? I don''t think so. Good!<br/> <br/>Seriously, this is vry well caught. I love the translucense of the eye stalks. Colors and focus are good. If it were me, I might have tried to color shift the background. Having said that, I would also have lacked the skill to do it well.  Really nice picture.</td>', 'Is a snail a bug? I don''t think so. Good! Seriously, this is vry well caught. I love the translucense of the eye stalks. Colors and focus are good. If it were me, I might have tried to color shift the background. Having said that, I would also have lacked the skill to do it well.  Really nice picture.', '2004-08-04 19:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(842998, 95199, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice subject well caught. Shadows distract me a bit.</td>', 'Nice subject well caught. Shadows distract me a bit.', '2004-08-04 19:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(842999, 93797, 20375, '<td valign="top">Top ten easily! I''m not the greatest fan of macro/bug shots but hell this good!<br/>Great job with the lighting. Focus is right on. Ribbon material!</td>', 'Top ten easily! I''m not the greatest fan of macro/bug shots but hell this good!Great job with the lighting. Focus is right on. Ribbon material!', '2004-08-04 19:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(843001, 94564, 18197, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what a hoverfly is, but I do know this is beautifully photographed. Focus is extraordinary. Colors pop. Detail is terrific. DOF work. Among my top picks.</td>', 'I don''t know what a hoverfly is, but I do know this is beautifully photographed. Focus is extraordinary. Colors pop. Detail is terrific. DOF work. Among my top picks.', '2004-08-04 19:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(843002, 95262, 20375, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition, use of colour and perspective.<br/>Top ten.</td>', 'Lovely composition, use of colour and perspective.Top ten.', '2004-08-04 19:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(843004, 94228, 20375, '<td valign="top">Excellent effort. Top ten.</td>', 'Excellent effort. Top ten.', '2004-08-04 19:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(843005, 94627, 18197, '<td valign="top">And thankfully not a bug or a flower. I like it ... color, focus, background, comp. Reflections are among its best aspects. Hope it does well.</td>', 'And thankfully not a bug or a flower. I like it ... color, focus, background, comp. Reflections are among its best aspects. Hope it does well.', '2004-08-04 19:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(843006, 94366, 20375, '<td valign="top">To me, this picture is just so warm. Good lighting and texture. Top ten.</td>', 'To me, this picture is just so warm. Good lighting and texture. Top ten.', '2004-08-04 19:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(843008, 95202, 20375, '<td valign="top">One of those shots were simplicity just makes it stand out so well.<br/>Top ten.</td>', 'One of those shots were simplicity just makes it stand out so well.Top ten.', '2004-08-04 19:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(843009, 95136, 18197, '<td valign="top">I think this is a risky photo for this challenge. It doesn''t feel like a macro shot to me. That being said, i really like it. The sharp focus on the flower and soft blurring of all else is powerful. It has high emotional impact. Terrific!</td>', 'I think this is a risky photo for this challenge. It doesn''t feel like a macro shot to me. That being said, i really like it. The sharp focus on the flower and soft blurring of all else is powerful. It has high emotional impact. Terrific!', '2004-08-04 19:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(843010, 95326, 15002, '<td valign="top">I really like this image!  I hope that you don''t get marked down because "it doesn''t look appetizing".  The contrast and composition are excellent.  10  Good Luck</td>', 'I really like this image!  I hope that you don''t get marked down because "it doesn''t look appetizing".  The contrast and composition are excellent.  10  Good Luck', '2004-08-04 19:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(843011, 95295, 18197, '<td valign="top">Contrast and negative space are the strongest aspects of this from my viewpoint. I like the lighting which is subtle. My only negative and it''s picky, is that it''s a bit busy.</td>', 'Contrast and negative space are the strongest aspects of this from my viewpoint. I like the lighting which is subtle. My only negative and it''s picky, is that it''s a bit busy.', '2004-08-04 19:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(843012, 95129, 20375, '<td valign="top">Very original. Nice job using a multiplicity of materials, colour and texture.</td>', 'Very original. Nice job using a multiplicity of materials, colour and texture.', '2004-08-04 19:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(843013, 94192, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautifully focused. Nicely lit. Background (shower door?) works. Well done.</td>', 'Beautifully focused. Nicely lit. Background (shower door?) works. Well done.', '2004-08-04 19:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(843015, 95316, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good idea but not so well lit. Technically, everything else is fine.</td>', 'Good idea but not so well lit. Technically, everything else is fine.', '2004-08-04 19:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(843019, 94881, 18197, '<td valign="top">I don''t ever want to get this close to a goose''s teeth! Hopefully you were using a long lens.</td>', 'I don''t ever want to get this close to a goose''s teeth! Hopefully you were using a long lens.', '2004-08-04 19:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(843020, 94247, 18197, '<td valign="top">This made me smile. Nicely done. Focus, DOF and reflections are very good. Colors are dramatic. So so comp. But still among the top third of teh bug pics.</td>', 'This made me smile. Nicely done. Focus, DOF and reflections are very good. Colors are dramatic. So so comp. But still among the top third of teh bug pics.', '2004-08-04 19:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(843021, 95102, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well executed but the subject doesn''t spark interest for me.</td>', 'Well executed but the subject doesn''t spark interest for me.', '2004-08-04 19:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(843022, 94260, 18197, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of the coin. I think a background more interesting than cork board would have helped. How about sand, or even better a rich black sand background?</td>', 'Excellent capture of the coin. I think a background more interesting than cork board would have helped. How about sand, or even better a rich black sand background?', '2004-08-04 19:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(843035, 93891, 25033, '<td valign="top">I really like this, I like the fact that you can see the detailed texture of the mask.  Thanks for sharing and good luck!</td>', 'I really like this, I like the fact that you can see the detailed texture of the mask.  Thanks for sharing and good luck!', '2004-08-04 20:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(843041, 95318, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very very nice spider capture. This is undoubtedly the best of the spiders. Their long legs make DOF a problem you solved nicely. Focus is sharp. Lighting good. Comp''s fine. Well done. Among my top picls.</td>', 'Very very nice spider capture. This is undoubtedly the best of the spiders. Their long legs make DOF a problem you solved nicely. Focus is sharp. Lighting good. Comp''s fine. Well done. Among my top picls.', '2004-08-04 20:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(843044, 94791, 18197, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is but I thinkI''d rather kiss my sister. <br/> <br/>Seriously, it''s a nicely captured image. High abstract quotient. Well focused with interesting DOF. Hope it does well.</td>', 'I don''t know what this is but I thinkI''d rather kiss my sister.  Seriously, it''s a nicely captured image. High abstract quotient. Well focused with interesting DOF. Hope it does well.', '2004-08-04 20:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(843047, 95171, 18197, '<td valign="top">High contrast is dramatic. Color is interesting. Focus on the subject is good. I think I would have preferred a lighter but blurred (via shallow DOF) background.</td>', 'High contrast is dramatic. Color is interesting. Focus on the subject is good. I think I would have preferred a lighter but blurred (via shallow DOF) background.', '2004-08-04 20:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(843048, 94364, 18197, '<td valign="top">Dying to be rich I guess. Sorry this doesn''t do too much for me. The technical capture is fine. Maybe I''m just bugged out. You obvioulsy have mastered the camera and composition. I hope you apply these often in future challenges.</td>', 'Dying to be rich I guess. Sorry this doesn''t do too much for me. The technical capture is fine. Maybe I''m just bugged out. You obvioulsy have mastered the camera and composition. I hope you apply these often in future challenges.', '2004-08-04 20:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(843050, 94536, 18197, '<td valign="top">At least it''s not a bug. Good technical capture. Less interesting subject and composition.</td>', 'At least it''s not a bug. Good technical capture. Less interesting subject and composition.', '2004-08-04 20:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(843051, 94523, 18197, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject (not a bug or a flower), lighting, focus, DOF, composition. It''s got a dramatic pop I like. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Excellent subject (not a bug or a flower), lighting, focus, DOF, composition. It''s got a dramatic pop I like. Among my top picks.', '2004-08-04 20:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(843053, 94163, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am sorry you didn''t get much closer. Maybe the sunflowers were too tall, as mine are. I think that would have felt more like a macro shot to me, and been more dramatic.</td>', 'I am sorry you didn''t get much closer. Maybe the sunflowers were too tall, as mine are. I think that would have felt more like a macro shot to me, and been more dramatic.', '2004-08-04 20:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(843055, 95229, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, beautiful picture. The colors are just gorgeous. The lighting is softly dramatic. The precise focus with medium DOF really supports the drama of the image. Among my top ten and a good candidate to ribbon.</td>', 'Beautiful, beautiful picture. The colors are just gorgeous. The lighting is softly dramatic. The precise focus with medium DOF really supports the drama of the image. Among my top ten and a good candidate to ribbon.', '2004-08-04 20:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(843057, 95311, 18197, '<td valign="top">For me, there is too little in focus. Colors and comp seem fine. I suppose there are more dramatic choices of bugs. I''m beginning to think black widow spiders might be a good recommendation for 70 or 80 DPCers. You have got good mastery of camera and comp. Just apply it to better subjects.</td>', 'For me, there is too little in focus. Colors and comp seem fine. I suppose there are more dramatic choices of bugs. I''m beginning to think black widow spiders might be a good recommendation for 70 or 80 DPCers. You have got good mastery of camera and comp. Just apply it to better subjects.', '2004-08-04 20:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(843058, 95129, 18197, '<td valign="top">GREAT sense of humor. Thank you for that! It''s a really good photo. Technically almost perfect. Hope it does well.</td>', 'GREAT sense of humor. Thank you for that! It''s a really good photo. Technically almost perfect. Hope it does well.', '2004-08-04 20:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(843059, 95237, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good subject, nicely focused and composed. Feels a bit over saturated.</td>', 'Good subject, nicely focused and composed. Feels a bit over saturated.', '2004-08-04 20:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(843062, 95343, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like sunflowers with some varigated color in their petals. This was a good choice. The detail of the center doesn''t seem to match the detail of the petals. Maybe a bit more light would have helped.</td>', 'I like sunflowers with some varigated color in their petals. This was a good choice. The detail of the center doesn''t seem to match the detail of the petals. Maybe a bit more light would have helped.', '2004-08-04 20:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(843064, 94688, 18197, '<td valign="top">Neat flower. I like the pattern of dark patches around the center. Much more interesting than a lot of plain old flowers we''ve seen the last few days. I''d like to see a bit more of the background but blurred by DOF. As it, there is just enough to be distracting, but not enough to be satisfying.</td>', 'Neat flower. I like the pattern of dark patches around the center. Much more interesting than a lot of plain old flowers we''ve seen the last few days. I''d like to see a bit more of the background but blurred by DOF. As it, there is just enough to be distracting, but not enough to be satisfying.', '2004-08-04 20:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(843065, 94602, 18197, '<td valign="top">A peppermint rose? Neat. And well photographed. Among the best of the flower pics.</td>', 'A peppermint rose? Neat. And well photographed. Among the best of the flower pics.', '2004-08-04 20:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(843067, 94348, 15002, '<td valign="top">Excellent work.  Simple subject  captured beautifully.  I have mixed feelings about the frame.  A frame does focus attention on the subject, and I like the gradient effect.  But the line between the frame and image at the top left is odd.  9<br/></td>', 'Excellent work.  Simple subject  captured beautifully.  I have mixed feelings about the frame.  A frame does focus attention on the subject, and I like the gradient effect.  But the line between the frame and image at the top left is odd.  9', '2004-08-04 20:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
