(843132, 93958, 22975, '<td valign="top">the lighting''s just a little too harsh for my tastes, but your macro shot is fantastic.  it''s very clear and i KNOW how tiny those buttons are... oh, and thanks for not putting a bug in this.  :)</td>', 'the lighting''s just a little too harsh for my tastes, but your macro shot is fantastic.  it''s very clear and i KNOW how tiny those buttons are... oh, and thanks for not putting a bug in this.  :)', '2004-08-04 21:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
