(844277, 94390, 18219, '<td valign="top">excellent picture, reminds me off Massive Attacks Mezzanine album!, which is probably why I voted this my favorite so far.</td>', 'excellent picture, reminds me off Massive Attacks Mezzanine album!, which is probably why I voted this my favorite so far.', '2004-08-05 08:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(844282, 94329, 8860, '<td valign="top">Not a bug, but not very interesting either I''m afraid. Bugs are fine so long as they are well shot in my opinion. <br/> <br/>There is too much going on in this, with the viewer left unsure what is the focal point. Image is a little noisy.</td>', 'Not a bug, but not very interesting either I''m afraid. Bugs are fine so long as they are well shot in my opinion.  There is too much going on in this, with the viewer left unsure what is the focal point. Image is a little noisy.', '2004-08-05 08:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(844284, 94935, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is not a gecko - it''s an anolis lizard. Not a bad shot but you are too far away from your subject to be ''involved'' in the shot and we are missing the interesting detail in the lizard''s skin. The bark is noce though!</td>', 'This is not a gecko - it''s an anolis lizard. Not a bad shot but you are too far away from your subject to be ''involved'' in the shot and we are missing the interesting detail in the lizard''s skin. The bark is noce though!', '2004-08-05 08:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(844285, 95167, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit but ultimately quite dull.  I try to aim for shots I''d like to hang and that will appeal to me outside of the challenge. While you may be a fan of this camera it''s not a shot that many people will enthuse about.</td>', 'Nicely lit but ultimately quite dull.  I try to aim for shots I''d like to hang and that will appeal to me outside of the challenge. While you may be a fan of this camera it''s not a shot that many people will enthuse about.', '2004-08-05 08:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(844286, 93877, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is quite gloomy and I''m left wondering what I''m looking at and why. The image is not close enough to show detail normally unseen, so ultimately it''s quite bland.</td>', 'This is quite gloomy and I''m left wondering what I''m looking at and why. The image is not close enough to show detail normally unseen, so ultimately it''s quite bland.', '2004-08-05 08:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(844288, 94753, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit - slightly awkward crop. More of chin and left side would be good.</td>', 'Nicely lit - slightly awkward crop. More of chin and left side would be good.', '2004-08-05 08:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(844303, 94037, 18450, '<td valign="top">Good focus and dof on your first insect macro! For me it adds to the appeal  of the image if I can see the face/front of the head.</td>', 'Good focus and dof on your first insect macro! For me it adds to the appeal  of the image if I can see the face/front of the head.', '2004-08-05 08:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(844322, 95326, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very unusual treatment of a common subject.<br/>The mix of textures and subdued lighting really add so much impact to this image.<br/>Love it...10<br/>My only 10 of the challenge and just added it to my favourites.</td>', 'Very unusual treatment of a common subject.The mix of textures and subdued lighting really add so much impact to this image.Love it...10My only 10 of the challenge and just added it to my favourites.', '2004-08-05 09:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(844368, 95158, 21430, '<td valign="top">Very nice subject matter. It has a great deal of texture and color contrast. <br/> <br/>Similar to my own shot, this might look better if shot at more of an angle. Instead of a 90 Degree straight into the Pepper, use a 45 or even 60 degree angle, which could add more DOF to the shot.<br/> <br/>It could add more interest to this otherwise nice shot. <br/> <br/>As it sits, I can see this hanging in someone''s kitchen, not as a huge overwhelming piece, but maybe as a 4x6 or 2x3 image in a nice kitchen related frame.</td>', 'Very nice subject matter. It has a great deal of texture and color contrast.  Similar to my own shot, this might look better if shot at more of an angle. Instead of a 90 Degree straight into the Pepper, use a 45 or even 60 degree angle, which could add more DOF to the shot. It could add more interest to this otherwise nice shot.  As it sits, I can see this hanging in someone''s kitchen, not as a huge overwhelming piece, but maybe as a 4x6 or 2x3 image in a nice kitchen related frame.', '2004-08-05 10:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(844371, 95167, 21430, '<td valign="top">This shot isn''t all that bad. It does suffer from a little washing out in a few spots, but that is darn difficult to avoid with the silvery coloration of the Digital Rebel. <br/> <br/>  With more of the camera showing, this would make a great advertisement shot, with less harsh lighting that is.</td>', 'This shot isn''t all that bad. It does suffer from a little washing out in a few spots, but that is darn difficult to avoid with the silvery coloration of the Digital Rebel.    With more of the camera showing, this would make a great advertisement shot, with less harsh lighting that is.', '2004-08-05 10:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
