(845966, 95171, 22659, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Bonus points for it not being a flower. Good job thinking outside the box.</td>', 'Nice shot. Bonus points for it not being a flower. Good job thinking outside the box.', '2004-08-06 02:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(845967, 95169, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excellent job with composition and focus. Just seems a bit too centered for my tastes. I guess I''m an off-center type of guy. Contrast seems a bit bright, as well as I don''t see anything really near a blackpoint. Many areas could be if adjusted properly such as the eyes, legs and the thorax. If the back part is not the thorax, please excuse me.  :)</td>', 'Excellent job with composition and focus. Just seems a bit too centered for my tastes. I guess I''m an off-center type of guy. Contrast seems a bit bright, as well as I don''t see anything really near a blackpoint. Many areas could be if adjusted properly such as the eyes, legs and the thorax. If the back part is not the thorax, please excuse me.  :)', '2004-08-06 02:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(845971, 94121, 8054, '<td valign="top">Colors are very rich and almost too rich. Maybe you oversharpened and cranked the saturation up, too. Not sure if my eyes are seeing correctly but I see some weird circular shapes up near the top middle and in the right corner. Maybe you cloned some odd bits out. I also think the background could have used more shallow DOF to make it less distracting.</td>', 'Colors are very rich and almost too rich. Maybe you oversharpened and cranked the saturation up, too. Not sure if my eyes are seeing correctly but I see some weird circular shapes up near the top middle and in the right corner. Maybe you cloned some odd bits out. I also think the background could have used more shallow DOF to make it less distracting.', '2004-08-06 02:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(845976, 94037, 8054, '<td valign="top">For some reason, my eyes feel more drawn to the orange part of the flower vs the bee. You did an excellent job with the composition and DOF is also good. I like how I can still make out the background as flowers but enough details are lost so they are not distracting. I think you also used a bit too much compression or maybe it''s just noise.</td>', 'For some reason, my eyes feel more drawn to the orange part of the flower vs the bee. You did an excellent job with the composition and DOF is also good. I like how I can still make out the background as flowers but enough details are lost so they are not distracting. I think you also used a bit too much compression or maybe it''s just noise.', '2004-08-06 02:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(845980, 94566, 22659, '<td valign="top">What kind of beetle is it? The kind that I wouldn''t let crawl on me without me freakin'' out. That is one creepy looking bug. Nice picture of it though.</td>', 'What kind of beetle is it? The kind that I wouldn''t let crawl on me without me freakin'' out. That is one creepy looking bug. Nice picture of it though.', '2004-08-06 02:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(845982, 94465, 8054, '<td valign="top">Wow, I knew moths were fuzzy but never that fuzzy. Nice sharp details of every stand of fuzz (except for the upper portions of the wings). Looks like the moth is a bit overexposed and maybe some curves and levels adjustment could fix that. Nice job overall.</td>', 'Wow, I knew moths were fuzzy but never that fuzzy. Nice sharp details of every stand of fuzz (except for the upper portions of the wings). Looks like the moth is a bit overexposed and maybe some curves and levels adjustment could fix that. Nice job overall.', '2004-08-06 02:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(845984, 94250, 22659, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Great detail. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice. Great detail. Well done.', '2004-08-06 02:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(845987, 95186, 22659, '<td valign="top">lol Very cool. The detail on t he nose is crisp. I hope he didn''t get your lens too slobbery. Great job.</td>', 'lol Very cool. The detail on t he nose is crisp. I hope he didn''t get your lens too slobbery. Great job.', '2004-08-06 02:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(845988, 95179, 22659, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the shell and nicely cropped. Very good.</td>', 'Great detail on the shell and nicely cropped. Very good.', '2004-08-06 02:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(845992, 95244, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very good as a b/w. I really like this one a lot. Crisp details and the petals are, for the most part, nicely focused. Off centered just enough to make it interesting. Tonal range seems a bit shallow as I see a dark gray as your blackpoint. Maybe you have a black near the middle but it''s hard to tell. Great job overall. 8</td>', 'Very good as a b/w. I really like this one a lot. Crisp details and the petals are, for the most part, nicely focused. Off centered just enough to make it interesting. Tonal range seems a bit shallow as I see a dark gray as your blackpoint. Maybe you have a black near the middle but it''s hard to tell. Great job overall. 8', '2004-08-06 02:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(845994, 94382, 8054, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems bright and focus is a bit off. I also see evidence of jagged lines which is probably due to resizing, too much compression or oversharpening.</td>', 'Lighting seems bright and focus is a bit off. I also see evidence of jagged lines which is probably due to resizing, too much compression or oversharpening.', '2004-08-06 02:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(845996, 95282, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus overall and that also hurts this image. I would have chosen a much simpler background without a pattern as not to disctract from the main subject.</td>', 'Nice sharp focus overall and that also hurts this image. I would have chosen a much simpler background without a pattern as not to disctract from the main subject.', '2004-08-06 02:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(846002, 95034, 8054, '<td valign="top">Correct me if I''m wrong but doesn''t the term snake eyes mean both die show the number 1? It''s rather difficult to tell here which number I''m supposed to look at but I see the number 5 on both first then the others. Lighting is also quite harsh and bright. I like the use of DOF to concentrate focus on the foreground die "ball" and it looks good.</td>', 'Correct me if I''m wrong but doesn''t the term snake eyes mean both die show the number 1? It''s rather difficult to tell here which number I''m supposed to look at but I see the number 5 on both first then the others. Lighting is also quite harsh and bright. I like the use of DOF to concentrate focus on the foreground die "ball" and it looks good.', '2004-08-06 02:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(846004, 94595, 8054, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite understand the title and how it relates to the subject of the photo. The surface feels overprocessed and maybe even oversharpened.</td>', 'I don''t quite understand the title and how it relates to the subject of the photo. The surface feels overprocessed and maybe even oversharpened.', '2004-08-06 02:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(846028, 95269, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, but I would have preferred the upper portion of the eye to be brighter.  White paper held under the eye to bounce the light onto it would have been enough.</td>', 'Nice focus, but I would have preferred the upper portion of the eye to be brighter.  White paper held under the eye to bounce the light onto it would have been enough.', '2004-08-06 03:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(846033, 94627, 18722, '<td valign="top">Looks like your tomatoe is glad to see you.  Nice capture, with a humor point.</td>', 'Looks like your tomatoe is glad to see you.  Nice capture, with a humor point.', '2004-08-06 03:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(846037, 94663, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice capture with wonderful colors, but the composition seems  off balanced to me and the DOF is too shallow for your point of focus (both the head and tail are OOF, while the hairs on the back are sharply in focus).</td>', 'Nice capture with wonderful colors, but the composition seems  off balanced to me and the DOF is too shallow for your point of focus (both the head and tail are OOF, while the hairs on the back are sharply in focus).', '2004-08-06 03:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(846040, 94296, 18722, '<td valign="top">The soft focus works well for the tender moment and subject.  The babies eyes are look to be expressive, but would be much more so if they were a bit brighter (a catchlight would help here).</td>', 'The soft focus works well for the tender moment and subject.  The babies eyes are look to be expressive, but would be much more so if they were a bit brighter (a catchlight would help here).', '2004-08-06 03:21:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(846045, 94901, 18722, '<td valign="top">There does not seem to be a center of attention (a specific part of the image the eyes are drawn to).  The frayed strings indicate a lot of use, but the image is quite static.  If the ball had been pressed into the strings I think it would have provided a stronger focus for attention.</td>', 'There does not seem to be a center of attention (a specific part of the image the eyes are drawn to).  The frayed strings indicate a lot of use, but the image is quite static.  If the ball had been pressed into the strings I think it would have provided a stronger focus for attention.', '2004-08-06 03:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(846051, 94470, 18722, '<td valign="top">The contrast of colors in this are great.  The only complaint I have is that the center of attention in this composition seems to be the dark underbelly of the bug and that it is moving out of the frame.</td>', 'The contrast of colors in this are great.  The only complaint I have is that the center of attention in this composition seems to be the dark underbelly of the bug and that it is moving out of the frame.', '2004-08-06 03:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(846056, 94681, 18722, '<td valign="top">The focus, DOF and clarity are great, but the composition is a bit right-sided.  Maintaining the wing in the frame on the left produced negative space that make it appear to be moving out of the scene.  More negative space on the right would have helped I think.</td>', 'The focus, DOF and clarity are great, but the composition is a bit right-sided.  Maintaining the wing in the frame on the left produced negative space that make it appear to be moving out of the scene.  More negative space on the right would have helped I think.', '2004-08-06 03:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(846061, 93652, 18722, '<td valign="top">The colors and detail are great.</td>', 'The colors and detail are great.', '2004-08-06 03:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(846064, 94235, 16241, '<td valign="top">very good</td>', 'very good', '2004-08-06 03:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(846065, 95269, 16241, '<td valign="top">beautiful and clear</td>', 'beautiful and clear', '2004-08-06 03:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(846066, 94664, 16241, '<td valign="top">very funny</td>', 'very funny', '2004-08-06 03:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(846067, 94526, 16241, '<td valign="top">stunning</td>', 'stunning', '2004-08-06 03:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(846068, 94228, 16241, '<td valign="top">brilliant</td>', 'brilliant', '2004-08-06 03:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(846069, 94999, 16241, '<td valign="top">excellent</td>', 'excellent', '2004-08-06 03:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(846071, 95186, 16241, '<td valign="top">funny..</td>', 'funny..', '2004-08-06 03:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(846099, 94247, 18552, '<td valign="top">This dragon fly really does have a funny face and almost looks like it''s smiling!  To my eyes, it would be nice to see a bit more of the body in focus.</td>', 'This dragon fly really does have a funny face and almost looks like it''s smiling!  To my eyes, it would be nice to see a bit more of the body in focus.', '2004-08-06 05:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(846100, 95132, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a cool picture! To my eyes, it would be even more interesting if there were more light on the snake''s face and more of his/her body was in focus. The color is lovely and I love the shine on the facial skin and eye.</td>', 'What a cool picture! To my eyes, it would be even more interesting if there were more light on the snake''s face and more of his/her body was in focus. The color is lovely and I love the shine on the facial skin and eye.', '2004-08-06 05:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(846101, 95232, 6349, '<td valign="top">My favorite photo in the challenge. 10</td>', 'My favorite photo in the challenge. 10', '2004-08-06 05:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(846102, 95282, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is really a wonderfully clear, colorful and well focused picture. I think it would have been much better against some other sort of background. It looks like it''s on denim or some other fabric.. The clarity of the hook and the writing is amazing. I''d really be interested to know what you used for lighting.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-09 01:48:14.</i></td>', 'This is really a wonderfully clear, colorful and well focused picture. I think it would have been much better against some other sort of background. It looks like it''s on denim or some other fabric.. The clarity of the hook and the writing is amazing. I''d really be interested to know what you used for lighting.', '2004-08-06 05:23:26.000000', '2004-08-09 02:48:14.000000', 1),
(846104, 95039, 18552, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is really up close and personal with an ant! The colors are great and the composition is pretty good, too. There is a lot of motion in the picture and not much is in focus. A faster shutter speed might have helped.</td>', 'Wow, this is really up close and personal with an ant! The colors are great and the composition is pretty good, too. There is a lot of motion in the picture and not much is in focus. A faster shutter speed might have helped.', '2004-08-06 05:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(846107, 94875, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really a nice picture. It looks fantastic in the thumbnail but at full size the highlights look blown out. I think the iridescence of the peacock feathers this close might confuse the camera.</td>', 'Really a nice picture. It looks fantastic in the thumbnail but at full size the highlights look blown out. I think the iridescence of the peacock feathers this close might confuse the camera.', '2004-08-06 05:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(846110, 94381, 18552, '<td valign="top">Unique idea. The colors on the fruit loops are great. The lighting is also good. I think a solid color background would have worked better, perhaps white - then the colors of the cereal would have been the only colors in the picture. Really a nice artistic idea!</td>', 'Unique idea. The colors on the fruit loops are great. The lighting is also good. I think a solid color background would have worked better, perhaps white - then the colors of the cereal would have been the only colors in the picture. Really a nice artistic idea!', '2004-08-06 05:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(846111, 95326, 18552, '<td valign="top">The blue on the berries is lovely. I think this would have been so much nicer without the dirt on the berries. The focus and lighting are really excellent.</td>', 'The blue on the berries is lovely. I think this would have been so much nicer without the dirt on the berries. The focus and lighting are really excellent.', '2004-08-06 05:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(846112, 93801, 18552, '<td valign="top">To me, this really doesn''t seem like a macro at all. You have very nice focus on the words. The background is very grainy.</td>', 'To me, this really doesn''t seem like a macro at all. You have very nice focus on the words. The background is very grainy.', '2004-08-06 05:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(846114, 93877, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture. The detail on the salt and peppercorns is good, I like the reflection underneath them a lot. The picture seems a bit grainy and dark to my eyes.</td>', 'Very interesting picture. The detail on the salt and peppercorns is good, I like the reflection underneath them a lot. The picture seems a bit grainy and dark to my eyes.', '2004-08-06 05:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(846116, 94743, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and different macro picture! The texture of the fabric on the emery strawberry is great and the colors are really nice. To me, the picture seems too busy with too many things not in focus - it might have been better with just one or three pins. The out of focus pins in front of the strawberry are especially distracting to me.</td>', 'Very interesting and different macro picture! The texture of the fabric on the emery strawberry is great and the colors are really nice. To me, the picture seems too busy with too many things not in focus - it might have been better with just one or three pins. The out of focus pins in front of the strawberry are especially distracting to me.', '2004-08-06 05:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(846117, 94948, 18552, '<td valign="top">How lovely. I love the colors. The water drops look like diamonds. It is perfect just the way it is!</td>', 'How lovely. I love the colors. The water drops look like diamonds. It is perfect just the way it is!', '2004-08-06 05:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(846119, 93883, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful colors, makes me feel happy just to look at it!.  It''s too bad that more of the dragon fly isn''t in focus but it''s lovely just the way it is.</td>', 'Really beautiful colors, makes me feel happy just to look at it!.  It''s too bad that more of the dragon fly isn''t in focus but it''s lovely just the way it is.', '2004-08-06 05:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(846120, 94512, 18552, '<td valign="top">Fabulous picture. The color and composition are just right. The focus on the caterpillar could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'Fabulous picture. The color and composition are just right. The focus on the caterpillar could be a bit sharper.', '2004-08-06 05:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(846121, 93652, 18552, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Can''t think of anything to improve it as it''s just right the way it is. The mud makes the perfect background for this colorful grasshopper.</td>', 'Great shot! Can''t think of anything to improve it as it''s just right the way it is. The mud makes the perfect background for this colorful grasshopper.', '2004-08-06 05:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(846122, 94729, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a nice picture. This is one of my favorites in the challenge - it makes this grasshopper look so cute and engaging.</td>', 'What a nice picture. This is one of my favorites in the challenge - it makes this grasshopper look so cute and engaging.', '2004-08-06 05:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(846125, 95053, 18552, '<td valign="top">It''s very nice to see an insect in flight in your macro shot. It''s too bad the focus is on the leaf instead of the fly. You did a good job though - I tried and tried to get a flying bug and found it totally impossible to focus on one!</td>', 'It''s very nice to see an insect in flight in your macro shot. It''s too bad the focus is on the leaf instead of the fly. You did a good job though - I tried and tried to get a flying bug and found it totally impossible to focus on one!', '2004-08-06 05:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(846127, 94029, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice job on lightong. The background is a bit distracting. The angle, I can see why but I dodn''t know if it would have been better to rotate it so more of the stone was showing.</td>', 'Nice job on lightong. The background is a bit distracting. The angle, I can see why but I dodn''t know if it would have been better to rotate it so more of the stone was showing.', '2004-08-06 05:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(846128, 94386, 10268, '<td valign="top">Very cool, but, I think it could use a better composition.  It just looks odd with the eye where it is.</td>', 'Very cool, but, I think it could use a better composition.  It just looks odd with the eye where it is.', '2004-08-06 05:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(846132, 95318, 10268, '<td valign="top">Those legs scare me.  But great photo.  8.</td>', 'Those legs scare me.  But great photo.  8.', '2004-08-06 05:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(846133, 94996, 11800, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Like the backlight. You did a very competent job photographing this.</td>', 'Great idea. Like the backlight. You did a very competent job photographing this.', '2004-08-06 05:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(846136, 95054, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good stock photo and something different for the challenge. I like the dof and composition.</td>', 'Good stock photo and something different for the challenge. I like the dof and composition.', '2004-08-06 05:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(846137, 94296, 24330, '<td valign="top">If this don''t win there''s no justice.<br/>The childs expression clinches it.<br/>Might crop a little stronger on the right, to the finger.<br/>But what do I know .<br/>Congrats on a GREAT shot.</td>', 'If this don''t win there''s no justice.The childs expression clinches it.Might crop a little stronger on the right, to the finger.But what do I know .Congrats on a GREAT shot.', '2004-08-06 05:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(846138, 94076, 11800, '<td valign="top">Really nice light. Crisp. Good job.</td>', 'Really nice light. Crisp. Good job.', '2004-08-06 06:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(846142, 95136, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Very well done technically. For a macro challenge, it might have been better to get right on the flower and even cut off some of the petals and make it fill the upper third of the frame.</td>', 'Nice shot. Very well done technically. For a macro challenge, it might have been better to get right on the flower and even cut off some of the petals and make it fill the upper third of the frame.', '2004-08-06 06:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(846146, 95105, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the texture of whatever it is over on the right. Generally hard to identify what everything is.</td>', 'I like the texture of whatever it is over on the right. Generally hard to identify what everything is.', '2004-08-06 06:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(846148, 93883, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like this one. The perspective is unique and the colors blend very well together. It''s a little over sharp,imo, but still nice to look at. Good job.</td>', 'I like this one. The perspective is unique and the colors blend very well together. It''s a little over sharp,imo, but still nice to look at. Good job.', '2004-08-06 06:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(846149, 94866, 11800, '<td valign="top">Very nice. That must be one tiny snail. Do you think it would have been better with a solid black background?</td>', 'Very nice. That must be one tiny snail. Do you think it would have been better with a solid black background?', '2004-08-06 06:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(846169, 94729, 5358, '<td valign="top">Think I''m going to have to move my score on this one up to a 10.  Great shot.</td>', 'Think I''m going to have to move my score on this one up to a 10.  Great shot.', '2004-08-06 06:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(846171, 93797, 5358, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Your nearly close enough to have to wear condom.  Excellent shot.</td>', 'Wow.  Your nearly close enough to have to wear condom.  Excellent shot.', '2004-08-06 07:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(846175, 94121, 5358, '<td valign="top">Thats some really bad cloning.  Might want to skip the solid brushes from now on and use one with a softer edge.</td>', 'Thats some really bad cloning.  Might want to skip the solid brushes from now on and use one with a softer edge.', '2004-08-06 07:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(846187, 95157, 5358, '<td valign="top">Bumpin'' this one up a point to a nine.  Great shot.</td>', 'Bumpin'' this one up a point to a nine.  Great shot.', '2004-08-06 07:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(846232, 93758, 8624, '<td valign="top">great title and a really interesting view of a common object.</td>', 'great title and a really interesting view of a common object.', '2004-08-06 08:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(846283, 95262, 23251, '<td valign="top">Unfortunatly your missing the same element as mine, nothing to show size.  This could be something huge.   I like the photo and colours.</td>', 'Unfortunatly your missing the same element as mine, nothing to show size.  This could be something huge.   I like the photo and colours.', '2004-08-06 09:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(846285, 94233, 23251, '<td valign="top">Sorry there is just not enough detail to work out what it is.</td>', 'Sorry there is just not enough detail to work out what it is.', '2004-08-06 09:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(846316, 94764, 21430, '<td valign="top">Not a bad concept, although this would probably work better in the miniature challenge that is running at the same time. The car is slightly out of focus/noisy.<br/> <br/>  I so like the relfection on the floor of this shot.</td>', 'Not a bad concept, although this would probably work better in the miniature challenge that is running at the same time. The car is slightly out of focus/noisy.   I so like the relfection on the floor of this shot.', '2004-08-06 10:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(846318, 95042, 21430, '<td valign="top">Why did you enter this shot into a Macro contest? This shot is, in my opinion, the farthest thing from a Macro shot.<br/> <br/>  Outside of far from meeting the challenge, the shot appears to have nice focus, it is an intereting capture. The washing out of the water near the bottom of the fountain is a nice touch. This is a good night shot.<br/> <br/>   Without this being close to the challenge at hand, I am unable to mark this very high.</td>', 'Why did you enter this shot into a Macro contest? This shot is, in my opinion, the farthest thing from a Macro shot.   Outside of far from meeting the challenge, the shot appears to have nice focus, it is an intereting capture. The washing out of the water near the bottom of the fountain is a nice touch. This is a good night shot.    Without this being close to the challenge at hand, I am unable to mark this very high.', '2004-08-06 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(846320, 95283, 21430, '<td valign="top">I like the way the noise adds to the image. The capture of the color is also impressive. <br/> <br/>I am interested in seeing what this ends up being.</td>', 'I like the way the noise adds to the image. The capture of the color is also impressive.  I am interested in seeing what this ends up being.', '2004-08-06 10:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(846324, 93710, 18450, '<td valign="top">this is a really interesting compostition...different and original idea. I would have liked to have seen a better definition on the snake''s head....it seems to merge into the light above.</td>', 'this is a really interesting compostition...different and original idea. I would have liked to have seen a better definition on the snake''s head....it seems to merge into the light above.', '2004-08-06 10:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(846326, 93648, 18450, '<td valign="top">nice angles and textures but I don''t find anything to focus on</td>', 'nice angles and textures but I don''t find anything to focus on', '2004-08-06 10:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(846331, 95118, 18450, '<td valign="top">good clear idea but there seems to be a lack of image quality especially in the middle of the pic and I feel the focus is a little soft</td>', 'good clear idea but there seems to be a lack of image quality especially in the middle of the pic and I feel the focus is a little soft', '2004-08-06 10:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(846333, 94432, 18450, '<td valign="top">Original idea, very interesting colours and textures. The light appears a little flat, I would love to see this image taken at different times of the day.</td>', 'Original idea, very interesting colours and textures. The light appears a little flat, I would love to see this image taken at different times of the day.', '2004-08-06 10:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(846361, 94348, 18450, '<td valign="top">I like this .....the imaginative macro idea, the colours, the focus, the dof and the lighting. I really like it!!</td>', 'I like this .....the imaginative macro idea, the colours, the focus, the dof and the lighting. I really like it!!', '2004-08-06 11:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(846366, 95132, 18450, '<td valign="top">like the idea but would like to see it with better lighting on the snake''s head. A lot of the detail seems to be lost in the shadows</td>', 'like the idea but would like to see it with better lighting on the snake''s head. A lot of the detail seems to be lost in the shadows', '2004-08-06 11:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(846379, 94617, 19177, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, it has wonderful color and detail. Great job!</td>', 'I love this photo, it has wonderful color and detail. Great job!', '2004-08-06 11:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(846382, 95239, 19177, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, you did a wonderful job. I like the colors - and the frame :)</td>', 'I love this photo, you did a wonderful job. I like the colors - and the frame :)', '2004-08-06 11:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(846406, 95138, 9690, '<td valign="top">Outside of the challenge, this wouldnt make much sense.  There is no connection between the filters and the broach</td>', 'Outside of the challenge, this wouldnt make much sense.  There is no connection between the filters and the broach', '2004-08-06 11:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(846408, 94394, 9690, '<td valign="top">The colors are dull.  Too subdued for my taste</td>', 'The colors are dull.  Too subdued for my taste', '2004-08-06 11:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(846409, 94121, 9690, '<td valign="top">Its too busy.  There is no focal point for the picture</td>', 'Its too busy.  There is no focal point for the picture', '2004-08-06 11:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(846412, 94827, 9690, '<td valign="top">Very good macro pic.  Great depth of field, and i like the softening effect of the framing.  Great job.</td>', 'Very good macro pic.  Great depth of field, and i like the softening effect of the framing.  Great job.', '2004-08-06 11:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(846414, 94652, 9690, '<td valign="top">Great close up.  Very crisp and clear.</td>', 'Great close up.  Very crisp and clear.', '2004-08-06 11:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(846416, 93758, 9690, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Took me a sec for my brain to wrap around this.  Very unique perspective</td>', 'Wow.  Took me a sec for my brain to wrap around this.  Very unique perspective', '2004-08-06 11:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
