(846861, 95220, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant colors that feel a bit oversaturated although they provide an excellent contrast to the more or less plain background. Slight vingetting in the upper and lower left corners that should have been cropped out. Nice use of DOF to concentrate on the middle section of flowers.</td>', 'Very vibrant colors that feel a bit oversaturated although they provide an excellent contrast to the more or less plain background. Slight vingetting in the upper and lower left corners that should have been cropped out. Nice use of DOF to concentrate on the middle section of flowers.', '2004-08-06 16:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(846863, 94688, 8054, '<td valign="top">The composition is very good but it''s hampered by slightly flat contrast. The upper left and right corners are quite distracting.</td>', 'The composition is very good but it''s hampered by slightly flat contrast. The upper left and right corners are quite distracting.', '2004-08-06 16:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(846866, 94866, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice details of the snail and the rose petals. Maybe the background could have been made less visible with the use of curves. Lighting is a bit bright and almost too direct.</td>', 'Nice details of the snail and the rose petals. Maybe the background could have been made less visible with the use of curves. Lighting is a bit bright and almost too direct.', '2004-08-06 16:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(846872, 94280, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus and DOF is also good. I question the composition as I would liked to have seen the negative space in the front of the berry rather than behind it. Lighting is also a bit off and so is contrast.</td>', 'Nice sharp focus and DOF is also good. I question the composition as I would liked to have seen the negative space in the front of the berry rather than behind it. Lighting is also a bit off and so is contrast.', '2004-08-06 16:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(846874, 94536, 8054, '<td valign="top">This needs some help with focusing. Maybe it''s due to the surface of the mouse components that are making it difficult. Contrast is also very flat. There also seems to be quite a bit of noise and compression artifacts.</td>', 'This needs some help with focusing. Maybe it''s due to the surface of the mouse components that are making it difficult. Contrast is also very flat. There also seems to be quite a bit of noise and compression artifacts.', '2004-08-06 16:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(846877, 94998, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very good composition. Colors are also very nice. DOF is well done with emphasis on the foremost kernel. But I do see lots of compression and noise.</td>', 'Very good composition. Colors are also very nice. DOF is well done with emphasis on the foremost kernel. But I do see lots of compression and noise.', '2004-08-06 17:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(846878, 94773, 8054, '<td valign="top">Background is quite distracting and focus seems to be off somewhat. The tongue is very blurry.</td>', 'Background is quite distracting and focus seems to be off somewhat. The tongue is very blurry.', '2004-08-06 17:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(846883, 95224, 8054, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what this is other than perhaps a yellow flower that''s out of focus. The background water drops seem more exciting than the yellow blur.</td>', 'Not quite sure what this is other than perhaps a yellow flower that''s out of focus. The background water drops seem more exciting than the yellow blur.', '2004-08-06 17:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(846960, 94602, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice texture &amp; detail - good looking flower.</td>', 'Nice texture & detail - good looking flower.', '2004-08-06 18:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(846966, 94349, 8860, '<td valign="top">It''s a close-up and focused but there''s something lacking in interest here. I think if you''re depth of field were almost complete from front to back this would look very good indeed. I also feel that filling the frame more (still offset to right) would involve the viewer more. Dark areas look a bit too burned and indistinct.</td>', 'It''s a close-up and focused but there''s something lacking in interest here. I think if you''re depth of field were almost complete from front to back this would look very good indeed. I also feel that filling the frame more (still offset to right) would involve the viewer more. Dark areas look a bit too burned and indistinct.', '2004-08-06 18:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(846969, 95314, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very busy shot, but it''s different and quite a brave submission. The more I look at this the more I like it in fact. I''m not keen on the darker, gloomier colours mind, but I hope this does better than I expect and that people spend some time to look at it a little longer.</td>', 'Very busy shot, but it''s different and quite a brave submission. The more I look at this the more I like it in fact. I''m not keen on the darker, gloomier colours mind, but I hope this does better than I expect and that people spend some time to look at it a little longer.', '2004-08-06 18:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(846970, 95224, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice vibe from this - I like the general feel and the composition. This would look good on a wall as a supersize poster in a Hoxton Square bar - deceivingly cool shot.</td>', 'Nice vibe from this - I like the general feel and the composition. This would look good on a wall as a supersize poster in a Hoxton Square bar - deceivingly cool shot.', '2004-08-06 18:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(846972, 94485, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nicely observed but not entirely pleasing shot due to the soft focus and washed-out colours. the composition is spot-on but you really need to work on the focus and depth of field to get the most out of a macro.</td>', 'Nicely observed but not entirely pleasing shot due to the soft focus and washed-out colours. the composition is spot-on but you really need to work on the focus and depth of field to get the most out of a macro.', '2004-08-06 18:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(846975, 95295, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition. Not much interst beyond that, but if people like flower shots, then they''ll probably go for this too.</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition. Not much interst beyond that, but if people like flower shots, then they''ll probably go for this too.', '2004-08-06 18:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
