(847167, 95171, 14700, '<td valign="top">And psychodelic!!!!! Man, this one time I did a batch of shrooms and then by pure coincedence these dragons showed up.  The weird part about that is that they wore hats?  Whats with that?  Why do dragons where hats?  Anywho, back to the point.... these dragons showed up... I know that people hallusinate when they do shrooms but I really think the dragons were there.  They spoke perfect english and endowed in me with total clarity for the rest of my life. 9.</td>', 'And psychodelic!!!!! Man, this one time I did a batch of shrooms and then by pure coincedence these dragons showed up.  The weird part about that is that they wore hats?  Whats with that?  Why do dragons where hats?  Anywho, back to the point.... these dragons showed up... I know that people hallusinate when they do shrooms but I really think the dragons were there.  They spoke perfect english and endowed in me with total clarity for the rest of my life. 9.', '2004-08-06 21:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(847168, 94220, 14700, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but it is not a macro.  Macro is considered lifesize or larger.</td>', 'Nice photo but it is not a macro.  Macro is considered lifesize or larger.', '2004-08-06 21:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(847171, 94928, 14700, '<td valign="top">I like that you tried to create a clean image with a white background.  It appears that the subject in your photo is a little "burnt".  This is what we call an subject that has been backlite to the point that it is overexposed from behind.</td>', 'I like that you tried to create a clean image with a white background.  It appears that the subject in your photo is a little "burnt".  This is what we call an subject that has been backlite to the point that it is overexposed from behind.', '2004-08-06 21:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(847174, 94938, 14700, '<td valign="top">I don''t think that such a narrow DOF works well with this subject.  It is a challenging subject to try to make interesting.</td>', 'I don''t think that such a narrow DOF works well with this subject.  It is a challenging subject to try to make interesting.', '2004-08-06 21:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(847175, 95118, 14700, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you already heard this in comments by now but it is pretty out of focus.  It is a rather cleaver idea I must add.</td>', 'I''m sure you already heard this in comments by now but it is pretty out of focus.  It is a rather cleaver idea I must add.', '2004-08-06 22:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
