(847342, 94401, 22659, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this is considered a macro shot. I think macro is supposed to show something bigger than actual size, not smaller. Unless this is a super miniature snow leopard species that I have never heard of. I could be wrong.  That said, I think it is a pretty good picture, nicely cropped and I love the lazy pose.   <br/> <br/>OOOPS! I just re-read the challenge description and notice that entries do not have to be a macro shot. A close up is fine. My appologies and I am bumping up the original score I gave you.</td>', 'I don''t think this is considered a macro shot. I think macro is supposed to show something bigger than actual size, not smaller. Unless this is a super miniature snow leopard species that I have never heard of. I could be wrong.  That said, I think it is a pretty good picture, nicely cropped and I love the lazy pose.    OOOPS! I just re-read the challenge description and notice that entries do not have to be a macro shot. A close up is fine. My appologies and I am bumping up the original score I gave you.', '2004-08-06 23:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
