(848283, 94531, 2158, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and detail here, but I think a contrasting background would have worked better.</td>', 'I like the composition and detail here, but I think a contrasting background would have worked better.', '2004-08-07 16:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
