(848296, 94366, 18644, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture. Nice depth to it. Not the nicest of apple. I would reshoot with a great red or green apple. But as for the challenge go. it''s a good vote from me!</td>', 'This is a great picture. Nice depth to it. Not the nicest of apple. I would reshoot with a great red or green apple. But as for the challenge go. it''s a good vote from me!', '2004-08-07 17:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(848316, 94999, 1847, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, due to the angle you took the photo at, the needle is almost invisible.</td>', 'Unfortunately, due to the angle you took the photo at, the needle is almost invisible.', '2004-08-07 18:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(848323, 95269, 11738, '<td valign="top">The unequal inner black border really detracts from this otherwise nice shot.  I also find that the white border is way too wide.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-09 08:03:33.</i></td>', 'The unequal inner black border really detracts from this otherwise nice shot.  I also find that the white border is way too wide.', '2004-08-07 18:13:26.000000', '2004-08-09 09:03:33.000000', 1),
(848351, 94386, 23394, '<td valign="top">love the shot.  what''s with the blue at the top left--something you couldn''t edit out &lt;g&gt;? must be the other eyeball.  great detail.  hope you do well.</td>', 'love the shot.  what''s with the blue at the top left--something you couldn''t edit out <g>? must be the other eyeball.  great detail.  hope you do well.', '2004-08-07 19:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(848353, 94445, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good, striking colour - focus is soft though.</td>', 'Good, striking colour - focus is soft though.', '2004-08-07 19:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(848354, 94245, 8860, '<td valign="top">Dynamic composition, nice feature with insect - image is quite noisy and indistinct where you need it most (on the fly).</td>', 'Dynamic composition, nice feature with insect - image is quite noisy and indistinct where you need it most (on the fly).', '2004-08-07 19:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(848357, 93635, 8860, '<td valign="top">Dynamic composition but there''s too much camera movement and some odd-shaped, unclear blackness.</td>', 'Dynamic composition but there''s too much camera movement and some odd-shaped, unclear blackness.', '2004-08-07 19:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(848361, 95313, 8860, '<td valign="top">Intriguing subject - focus is too shallow and colours are bland and washed out. The dirt on the features is off-putting.</td>', 'Intriguing subject - focus is too shallow and colours are bland and washed out. The dirt on the features is off-putting.', '2004-08-07 19:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(848369, 94390, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition. Good detail and a clear image but, if anything, this looks so staged and therefore lacks contextual interest, ie, it''s a beetle on white but why, how, etc?</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition. Good detail and a clear image but, if anything, this looks so staged and therefore lacks contextual interest, ie, it''s a beetle on white but why, how, etc?', '2004-08-07 19:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(848376, 94228, 8860, '<td valign="top">Strong image - no illusion here for me (so I would have left it out of the title), but it''s a good idea, well lit but just a bit too obviously set up with water/upside down, etc. I''d have tinted the liquid at least. Very nice composition and an unusual macro.</td>', 'Strong image - no illusion here for me (so I would have left it out of the title), but it''s a good idea, well lit but just a bit too obviously set up with water/upside down, etc. I''d have tinted the liquid at least. Very nice composition and an unusual macro.', '2004-08-07 19:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(848377, 95158, 8860, '<td valign="top">It''s a noisy image and quite dull really. This needs better lighting (low ISO?) and more of a purpose perhaps. Imagine trying to sell the product to a food producer or something and it will help you make it look more appealing.</td>', 'It''s a noisy image and quite dull really. This needs better lighting (low ISO?) and more of a purpose perhaps. Imagine trying to sell the product to a food producer or something and it will help you make it look more appealing.', '2004-08-07 19:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(848378, 94664, 8860, '<td valign="top">Odd title (though funny if the flies were a bit out of practice at sex) - nice macro.</td>', 'Odd title (though funny if the flies were a bit out of practice at sex) - nice macro.', '2004-08-07 19:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(848379, 94121, 11738, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if you actually did, but this image screams oversaturation.  It really looks like you ramped blue up way too much.  The confusing pattern also creates a lack of focal interest: the eyes wander all over the image without finding any single point to be drawn to.  Keep experimenting.</td>', 'I don''t know if you actually did, but this image screams oversaturation.  It really looks like you ramped blue up way too much.  The confusing pattern also creates a lack of focal interest: the eyes wander all over the image without finding any single point to be drawn to.  Keep experimenting.', '2004-08-07 19:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(848380, 94663, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very nice, clear, nicely toned study. A touch noisy but it doesn''t spoil it for me.</td>', 'Very nice, clear, nicely toned study. A touch noisy but it doesn''t spoil it for me.', '2004-08-07 19:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(848381, 94627, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nicely observed - needed a sexy title though! Good macro, well lit - nice colours.</td>', 'Nicely observed - needed a sexy title though! Good macro, well lit - nice colours.', '2004-08-07 19:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(848383, 94980, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great observation - lovely texture and comp.</td>', 'Great observation - lovely texture and comp.', '2004-08-07 19:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(848384, 95042, 8860, '<td valign="top">While this looks pretty - nice motion and light - you get a 1 for the challenge (which probably will come as no surprise to you!  : )</td>', 'While this looks pretty - nice motion and light - you get a 1 for the challenge (which probably will come as no surprise to you!  : )', '2004-08-07 19:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(848385, 95311, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very interesting viewpoint and nicely shot. DOF is a little narrow to be truly informative.</td>', 'Very interesting viewpoint and nicely shot. DOF is a little narrow to be truly informative.', '2004-08-07 19:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(848388, 95239, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice image - but looks a little sterile due to lack of natural context. Very striking set-up and a good macro.</td>', 'Nice image - but looks a little sterile due to lack of natural context. Very striking set-up and a good macro.', '2004-08-07 19:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(848390, 95186, 8860, '<td valign="top">Awkward crop - cracking subject - lovely texture - overxposed - but I like it!</td>', 'Awkward crop - cracking subject - lovely texture - overxposed - but I like it!', '2004-08-07 19:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(848391, 95329, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colour. Less noise would be good but I like the lighting and design in this,.</td>', 'Nice composition and colour. Less noise would be good but I like the lighting and design in this,.', '2004-08-07 19:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(848393, 93891, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lighting effect has been lost due to the face-on lighting on the mask. This needed some directional lighting from left only to pick up feature lines but leaving the glow from the eyes to be more atmospheric. This said - I''m not really sure what you''re trying to achieve.</td>', 'Lighting effect has been lost due to the face-on lighting on the mask. This needed some directional lighting from left only to pick up feature lines but leaving the glow from the eyes to be more atmospheric. This said - I''m not really sure what you''re trying to achieve.', '2004-08-07 19:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
