(849649, 95314, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully different and very beautiful.   Makes a great abstract--I wonder if the macro impact might have been greater though if you limited the scope a little more--it''s busy for a macro (but works well aesthetically anyway)..</td>', 'Wonderfully different and very beautiful.   Makes a great abstract--I wonder if the macro impact might have been greater though if you limited the scope a little more--it''s busy for a macro (but works well aesthetically anyway)..', '2004-08-08 22:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(849656, 94381, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice color scheme.  It''s quite simple, but also effective.  Seems to have a lot of noise hought--maybe jpeg artifacts, and this takes away from all the interesting texture.</td>', 'Very nice color scheme.  It''s quite simple, but also effective.  Seems to have a lot of noise hought--maybe jpeg artifacts, and this takes away from all the interesting texture.', '2004-08-08 22:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(849658, 94386, 12253, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail and great color.  However, to me this misses compositionally, even though the eye is in the sweet spot for the rule of thirds.  The problem, to my eye, is that the detail is "increasing" with the folds to the right, and yet it''s cropped off there.  Just looks to me here that if the eye were in the upper left sweet spot it would work better.  Also, the brighter area in the back left distracts a little.</td>', 'Amazing detail and great color.  However, to me this misses compositionally, even though the eye is in the sweet spot for the rule of thirds.  The problem, to my eye, is that the detail is "increasing" with the folds to the right, and yet it''s cropped off there.  Just looks to me here that if the eye were in the upper left sweet spot it would work better.  Also, the brighter area in the back left distracts a little.', '2004-08-08 22:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(849661, 93883, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  Very nice color and subject isolation.  However, one of the prettiest things about dragons are the wings, and there''s just not enough wing in focus here.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  Very nice color and subject isolation.  However, one of the prettiest things about dragons are the wings, and there''s just not enough wing in focus here.', '2004-08-08 23:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
