(849760, 95042, 12253, '<td valign="top">This looks like a very good fountain shot--really smooth water!  But it''s too small to see much here.  The crop seems too extreme--the sides of the fountain are important here, and the crop is otherwise too tight. all around.  Perhaps you were trying for a macro effect, but a macro effect isn''t the same as a tightly cropped photo--you need to be closeup or show fine details of the image that you would only see if you were closeup.</td>', 'This looks like a very good fountain shot--really smooth water!  But it''s too small to see much here.  The crop seems too extreme--the sides of the fountain are important here, and the crop is otherwise too tight. all around.  Perhaps you were trying for a macro effect, but a macro effect isn''t the same as a tightly cropped photo--you need to be closeup or show fine details of the image that you would only see if you were closeup.', '2004-08-09 00:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(849766, 93797, 7485, '<td valign="top">Can you get disqualified for submitting a micro-shot in a macro contest?  ;-)</td>', 'Can you get disqualified for submitting a micro-shot in a macro contest?  ;-)', '2004-08-09 00:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
