(850536, 94729, 489, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for all of the nice comments. This was one of maybe 20 different shots I took of grasshoppers at the park - they are very easy to get close to, much like Praying Mantis. <br/> <br/>However, they are just shy enough to be interesting - they like to peer around the grass blades to keep an eye on you, so to speak, and this makes for almost comical expressions.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks everyone for all of the nice comments. This was one of maybe 20 different shots I took of grasshoppers at the park - they are very easy to get close to, much like Praying Mantis.  However, they are just shy enough to be interesting - they like to peer around the grass blades to keep an eye on you, so to speak, and this makes for almost comical expressions. ', '2004-08-09 10:23:02.000000', NULL, 0),
