(851006, 93797, 17613, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot.............</td>', 'Fantastic shot.............', '2004-08-09 15:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(851058, 94228, 3724, '<td valign="top">Very good work.....  I also would like to see a "how to".<br/>I am taken with the interaction of title and image.  It appears a simple and obvious pairing.  Without a title the image fits as POP ART - to me a Lichtenstein - without the halftone or an Oldenberg giant cork study.  <br/>The title without the image - is a beautifully condensed definition of POP ART.  I voted this a seven....  It is a solid piece of work.  As for faults probably none except my perception - This great image easily bends to a entrepreneurial purpose.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Very good work.....  I also would like to see a "how to".I am taken with the interaction of title and image.  It appears a simple and obvious pairing.  Without a title the image fits as POP ART - to me a Lichtenstein - without the halftone or an Oldenberg giant cork study.  The title without the image - is a beautifully condensed definition of POP ART.  I voted this a seven....  It is a solid piece of work.  As for faults probably none except my perception - This great image easily bends to a entrepreneurial purpose.  Congratulations.', '2004-08-09 16:31:08.000000', NULL, 0),
